<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Tagin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc1">JON gv Gamlv milambv</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">JON</para>
  <para style="mt2">gv Gamlv Milambv</para>
  <para style="imt">Mintamchonam</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Jon gv Gamlv milambv</char> minam si Jisunyi turbwngla doonv Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar gubv kaatamdo, yvvdw “Nyi gubv rilinla okv ngonugv dooku lo dooming gvkunv.” Kitap si atuv minsudo, so Gamlv sam vkvlvgabv lvkpvnv sum puririnv vdwv Jisunyi milvvnam Ringnv gubv, Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo gubv vla mvngjwng morung dukubv, okv vbv bunugv ninyia mvngjwng kolokv bunu turnama paadu kubv (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Jisunyi Pwknvyarnv gv turbwngnv gamchar v vla kaatamro kochingbv minchonam Gamlv lo Jisu mvpu nvbv okv milv jinam Ringnv ngv, Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv vla kaatam nvnv bv lamrwpadubv mvnam rinam a kaatam jito. Ho kochingbv lamrwpadubv mvnam rinam gv lvga nga minji kunamv. Atung gonv kitaplo ogubv Jisunyi nyi tunggonv vdwv jvjvbv mvngla okv ninyia reming gvnvgubv rikunamv, vbvrijvka nyi tunggonv ninyia rinyingla okv ninyia mvngjwng manam gv lvga nga lvkto. Mvrwmvpa 13-17 lo Jisunyi naatungdw ariumlo ninyia reming gvnv vdwam Jisu gv doobam namamla ninyia takki madvbv ninyigv minpvripv okv mintv hartv jinam a mego lvkpv.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lvknya nvnv mvrwmvpa lo Jisunyi naatung laku kvba baakanam, ninyi daapo lo takkinam, okv turkurkunam, okv turkurro kochingbv ninyi riming gvnv vdwlo kaatam siku nama lvkpv.</para>
  <para style="ip">Rimurnv nyimv nga goknam higu (8:1-11) sum mvrwku arwng lo vvpvdo, ogulvgavbolo lvkchonam kitap vdwlo sum naala naa nyatoku. Vbvrijvka atung gonvlo hum lvkta toku.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kristo gvlokv turbwngnam singnam okv Jisu lamtv ngv, jvjv ngv okv turnam v vla naarwksinv vdwam jinyubv amin jinam gv lvga nga Jon pvbwng vrwng yabv mindu. Jon gv lvknam gaam sum makar dubv gaam akonv minchisinam a, lokia gwnggvsinggv nvnv yikungyira nga minvnvto, ho hv yalu lvga am miring nvbv Isi, Vtwng, loung, Svlar kaayanv okv ninyigv Svlar, okv Anggor miami okv ho gv apw asi vnam vdw si.</para>
  <para style="iot">Arwng lokv darlinnam</para>
  <para style="io1">Rirapminrap kunam<char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jon Baptist okv Jisu gv lvbwlaksu richonv <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisu nyi vdwlo ridungripa rikunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Rinya alu okv Jerusalem nvchilo <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Turkurkunam okv Ahtu gv kaatamsikunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lvknya: Galili lo lvkin guda kaatamsikunam <char style="ior">(<ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Turnam gv Gamchar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Nyiamooku a pwklin madvbv, Gamchargo doocho toku; Gamchar v Pwknvyarnv gv lvkobv dooto, okv Gamchar hv Pwknvyarnvnyi akinnv. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Gamchar v doorap lokv Pwknvyarnv gv lvkobv dooto. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Ninyigv lokv Pwknvyarnv ogumvnwngnga pwklin to; pwknamyarnam mvnwng lokv ako daka ninyia dooma mogvrila mvnam go kaama. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Gamchar v turnam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gamchar v turnam gv linkubv rito; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ogugo mvpvkudw v turnammv Gamchar a lvkobv</char></note> gv linkubv rito, okv so turnam si nyi mvnwngnga loung naalwk jitoku. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Loung ngv kanv lo ungto, okv kanv ngv hum vdwloka mvngit nyuma toku.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Pwknvyarnv ninyigv gindungpingko nga vngmuto, ho nyi gv aminv Jon, <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>hv nyi vdwa loung gv lvkwngbv minji tvbv aatoku, vkvlvgavbolo mvnwngngv doin a tvvgvrikula mvngjwng rungdukubv. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Hv atubongv loung mato; hv loung gv lvkwngbv minpa tvvbv aatoku. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>So si jvjvbv alvyachoknv loung ngv—Loung ngv nyiamooku lo aatoku okv nyi mvnwnglo ungtoku.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Gamchar v nyiamooku lo dootoku, okv ninyigv lokv Pwknvyarnv ogumvnwngnga mvlin bvka, vbvrijvka nyia nyi vdwv ninyia kaachin matoku. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Hv atugv mooku lo aatoku, vbvritola ninyigv nyi vdwv ninyia naarwk sumato. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Megonv, ninyia naarwk sutoku, okv ninyia mvngjwng toku; vkvlvgabv hv bunua Pwknvyarnv gv kuu bv ridubv tolwk toku. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Hv manv, bunu tanyi anvabu gv kuu bvngchwng lokv Pwknvyarnv gv kuu bv rima; Pwknvyarnv atubongv bunugv abu bv rito. <verse eid="JHN 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Gamchar v nyi gobv rilin toku okv jvjv okv aya ngv yarbing nvgobv rila, ngonugv dookurikulo doomingriming gvto. Ngonu ninyigv yunglit nama kaatoku, ninyigv Abu gv Kuunyilo hotum gubvrila yunglit nvgobv paanam a.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Jon ninyigv lvkwngbv japjito. Hv kapla minto, “So si ngoogv minam v ngo vbv minto, ‘Hv ngoogv kochinglo aadu, vbvritola hv nga kaiyanv, ogulvgavbolo hv nga bvngma dwbv doolin chonv.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Hv aya gv yarbing kolokv hv ngonu mvnwngnga achialvbv ayato, ako jidv gv aolo ako jitamla bokta jidv toku. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Moses gv lokv Pwknvyarnv Pvbv nga jito, vbvritola jvjv okv aya ngv Jisu Kristo gvlokv aatoku. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Yvvka Pwknvyarnvnyi kaakw nvgo kaama. Kuunyilo mvngchik, Abu gvlo doonv, Pwknvyarnvnyi akin kunv, hv bunua Pwknvyarnvnyi chimu toku.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jon baptist gv doin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mt 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Lk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Jerusalem gv Jius rigvdakgvnv vdwv nyibu vkvla okv Lebait mego vngmuto, Jonnyi “No yvvla?” vla tvvka modubv.<verse eid="JHN 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Jon mirwk siji makv vmato, vbvritola pvbwng vrwngbv minpok jitoku, svbv minto: “Ngo Kristo ma.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mt 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Lk 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>Bunu tvkato, “Vbvrikunamv no yvvla? No Elija re?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ma, ngo ma,” Jon mirwkto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Bunu tvvkato, “No Nyijwk vri?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyijwk</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ho angv aalwk rungre vla Kristo gv aanamma minggo jinv gubv rire vla dvminkunamv </char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Hv mirwkto, “Ma”.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>“Vbvrikunamv ngonua minjilabv no yvvla,” bunu minto. “Ngonu ngonua kanamnv vdwa vngkur dukula mirwk jireku.” “No atubongv ogu vla minsu dunv?”<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Aij 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jon Aijaya gv minam a mintaknvla mirwk sitoku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Chukrimooku lo nyi ako gokdungdo ho vlv angv ngo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Ahtu gv lvgabv vngdubv lamtv nga sorchi dubv mvtoka!”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Gindungpingko vdwv, Parisis vdwgv vngmukunam vdwv, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>vbvrikunamv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gindungpingko vdwv’ parisis vdwgv vngmukunaamv, vbvrikunamv</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">parisis vdwgv vngmu kunam vdwv bunnu</char></note> Jonnyi tvvkato, “No Kristo mabolo vmalo Elija vmaloka Nyijwk ngvma bolo, no ogubv Baptisma jidunv?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Jon mirwkto, “Ngo nonua isi lokv Baptisma jidunv, vbvritola nonugv pingkolo nonugv chimanam nyi go daklinre. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Hv ngoogv kochinglo aadungdu, vbvritola ngo ninyigv lvkiam gv oso haka taasok yadubvka riyin yama.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>So mvnwng si Betani lo ritoku Jordan svko gv doonyi chaalin kiambv, Jon gv baptisma jidung kolo.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pwknvyarnv gv Svlarkuu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Alu loogu nvnga Jon Jisunyi ninyi gvlo aadu bv kaagv rikula minto, “Hvvnv Pwknvyarnv gv svlarkuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Svlarkuu: Krim nyi vdwv svlarkuu nga erin nvla rimur a mva sula svngnya toku</char></note> ngv nyiamooku gv rimur a naa jikunv! <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>So siinv ngoogv minamv, ‘Nyi go ngo kochingbv aadungdu, vbvritola hv nga kaiyanv, ogulvgavbolo hv nga bvngma dwbv doolinchonv.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Ngo chimato hv yvvdw, vbvritola ngo Israel nyi vdwa ninyia chimu dubv vla isi lokv baptisma jila aapvnv.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Okv Jon so gv gaam sum minji toku: “Ngo nyido ao tolokv Darwknv Dow v taakw jvbv ritola nw gvlo jarlwkla doodubv kaatoku. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Hvkunyi vla vjaklodvbv ngo chima toku, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv, yvvdw nga isi lokv baptisma jidubv aamunv, hv nga svbv minto, ‘No Dow a ila nyi ako gvlo doolwk dubv kaapare; ho nyi angv Darwknv Dow lokv baptisma jiji kunv.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Um ngo kaatoku,” Jon minto, “Okv ngo nonua minjidunv hv kunv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv Lvbwlaksubv richonv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Alu loogu nvnga Jon ninyigv Lwbwlaksu anyia lvkobv hoka lvkodv dakdvto, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Vdwlo hv Jisunyi hoka vngdubv kaapa tokudw hv minto, “Vnv Pwknvyarnv gv Svlarkuu ngv!”<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Lwbwlaksu anyiv ninyia svbv mindubv tvvgvrikula Jisunyi lvkobv vngming gvtoku. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Jisu dakur toku, okv bunua ninyia vngming gvdubv kaato, okv tvvkato, “Nonu ogugola kaadung dunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Bunu mirwkto, “Rabbi, no ogulo doodunv?” (Rabbi vnam si “Tamsarnv” vla minam v).<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Hv mirwkto, “Aala kaatoka.” (Vbvrikunamv ho doonyiv tabv laku api baji toku.) Vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia vngming gvtoku okv ninyigv dooku a kaatoku, okv ho alu lo ninyia lvkobv doomwng gvtoku.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Bunugv lokv akonv Andriu, Saimon Pitar gv boru. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Vjakgobv ninyigv achi Saimonnyi kaapa toku okv ninyia minto, “Ngonu Messianyi paapvku.” (So gv minam si “Kristo”) <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Vbvrikunamv hv Saimonnyi Jisu gvlo aagv toku. Jisu ninyia kaatoku okv minto, “No gv aminv Saimon Jon gv kuunyilo, vbvritola nam Kepas vla minreku.” (So minam si Pitar vla minam a akin v, “Vlwng lvngrak vnammv.”)<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pilip nyila Natanaelnyi goknam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Alu loogu nvnga Jisu Galili lo vngdubv mvngtoku. Hv Pilipnyi kaapato okv ninyia minto, “Ngoogv lvkobv vngming gvlaak!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Pilip Betsaida lokv, Pitar gvla Andriu gv dooku banggu akin gvngv. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Pilip Natanael nyika kaapa toku okv ninyia minpa toku, “Ngonu Pvbv kitaplo Moses gv lvknam okv nyijwk vdwgv lvkpanam nyi anga paapvku. Hv Jisu Josep gv kuunyilo, Najareth lokv.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>“Najareth lokv alvnv yikungyira ngv linla dunvdw?” vla Natanael tvkato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Pilip mirwkto, “Aato okv kaalak.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Vdwlo Jisu Natanaelnyi ninyi gvlo aadukubv kaatokudw nyi ho gv lvgabv minto, “Siinv Israel nyi jvngv; ninyi gvlo mvvnamrunam go kaama!”<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanael ninyia tvkato, “No nga oguaingbv chimpvnv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jisu mirwkto, “Pilip gv nam gokma dwbv ngo nam koksitkokrik singnv kolv lo doodubv kaato.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanael mirwk sitoku, “Tamsarnv,” “No kunyi Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv! No Israel gv Dvbv ngvku!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Jisu minto, “Nam ngo koksitkokrik singnv kolv lo kaapvnv vnam lokv no nga mvngjwng mvngdunvre? No sumka kaiyanv awgo kaapare!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Atk 28:12</ref></char></note> Okv nw bunua minto, “Ngo nonua jvjv nvnga minjidunv: nonu nyidomooku agi hv kokok dubv okv Pwknvyarnv gv Gindungpingko ngv Nyia Kuunyilo gvlo ila chaala ridubv kaapare.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kana lo Nyida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Alu lonyi kochingbv Galili gv banggu Kana lo nyida go rito. Hoka Jisu gv Anv ngv dooto, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>okv nyida hoka Jisu nyila okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa gokto. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Vdwlo anggor ala nga jinya pvkudw, Jisu gv anv ngv ninyia minto, “Bunu gvlo anggor ala kaakuma.”<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>“Ogugo rise ngvdw no ngam mingkwng svgo kaama,” Jisu mirwkto. “Ngo gv dw ngv vjak aatv madv.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Jisu gv Anv ngv pakbu vdwa minto, “Hv ogugo nonua minredw ritoka.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Jius vdwv pvbv doola arwanyu harkak nanvbv, hoka takam pvchwng vkv pwkv go dooto, pvchwng pwkinnv kai ngv isi laajok lvngbv go aajinv vkv. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Jisu pakbu vdwa minto, “Pvchwng vdw soka isi lokv pwbing tvka.” Bunu pvchwng lvnggung lo godubv pwbing to, <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>okv vbvrikunamv hv bunua minto, “Vjak isi kvgonyi joklin gvrila nyida nga rigvnv nyi hum jitoka.” Bunu isi a ninyi bvngji toku, <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>hv vjak anggor ala bv ritoku, okv nw hum tvngka toku. Hv anggor ala hv ogolokv aapvnvdw hum nw chimato (vbvritola, isi a joklinnv pakbu vdwv chinto); vkvlvgabv hv makbu rijinv anga goklwkto <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>okv minto, “Nyi mvnwngngv tvngpunv anggor ala alvyanv nga jicho dvnv yikv, okv nyen vdwgv tvnggu dubv tvngro kochingbvku, hv sarchik nvnga jidunv. Vbvritola nonu vjaklodvbv anggor ala alvyachok nvnga doobwng mopv!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Jisu so lamrwpadubv mvnam a Galili gv kana lo riturike bv rito; hoka hv ninyigv kai nama kaatam toku, okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyi mvngjwng toku.<verse eid="JHN 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mt 4:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>So kochingbv, Jisu okv ninyigv Anv, achiboru vdwv, okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Kaparnaum bv vngtoku okv hoka lonyi loum go dootoku.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo aatoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mt 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Lk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Mog 12:1-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note> So si vngbokunam pumja ridwv nvchibv ritoku, vkvlvgabv Jisu Jerusalem bv vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Hoka Pwknvyarnvnaam arwng lo svv pioknv nyi, svlar, okv taakw, okv morko lwkmisinv vdwa tvbul lo doodubv hv kaapa toku. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Vkvlvgabv hv svnwngsvmin mvnwngnga bangngi lokv dvnggvrila Pwknvyarnvnaam loka charlin toku, svlar okv svv vdwaka; hv morko lwknv vdwgv tvbulla ngora jito okv bunugv morko lokdwng ngv kaayak padubv mvtoku; <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>okv hv taakw pyoknv nyi vdwa minto, “Bunua sokv agumlo bvngroto! ngo abu gv naam a bajar mookubv mvku mabvka!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Miri 69:9</ref></char></note>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv mvngpa nyatoku Darwknv Kitaplo mindu, “Ho Pwknvyarnv no gv naam ha ngoogv mvngbiula kumnam si vmv jvbv gudu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Jius nyi kainv vdwv Jisunyi mirwkla tvuto, “No sum rila dunv vla ngonua ogu lamrwpanam go rila kaatamre?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mt 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu mirwkto, “So Pwknvyarnvnaam sum toyak tvka okv ngo alu loum lo sum mvdi jiriku.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>“No alu loum lo sum mvdi jitv dunvre? Vla bunu ninyia tvvkato. Sum Pwknvyarnvnaam sum mvdubv anying champi gola nyingkv gobv ripvnv!”<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Vbvritola Jisu gv Pwknvyarnvnaam vnam si ninyigv ayakka minpvnv. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Vkvlvgabv vdwlo nw sinam lokv turkur tokudw, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv nw sum minpvnv vla mvngpa toku, okv bunu Darwknv Kitap okv Jisu ogugo mimpvkudw hum mvngjwng toku.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi singdung nga Jisu gv chinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Vngbodvnam pumja lo Jisu gv Jerusalem lo doolwk dvla, ninyigv lamrwpadubv mvnam rinam a kaala awgo nyi vdwv ninyia mvngjwng toku. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Vbvritola Jisu atubongv bunua mvngjwk matoku, ogulvgavbolo hv bunu mvnwngnga chintoku. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Hoka bunugv lvgabv yvvka ninyia minji sego kaamato, ogulvgavbolo bunugv haapok arwnglo ogugo doopvdw hum atuv chinsu toku.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Nikodemas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Hoka Jius vdwa rigvnv nyi go aminv Nikodemas vnamgo dooto, hv Parisis haalung lokv. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Ayu yupgolo hv Jisu gvlo vngto okv ninyia tvvkato, “Tamsarnv, ngonu chindu Pwknvyarnv nam tamsarnvbv vla vngmupvnv. Yvvka no gv rinam vbv lamrwpadubv rinam a rinyu mare Pwknvyarnv ngv ninyia lvkobv dooming gvma bolo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngo nam jvjvbv mindunv; Lvnyibv kuu bvngdi kuma bolo yvvka Pwknvyarnv gv Karv nga kaapa kumare.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lvkodv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aolokv</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>“Nyi ngv nyigabv rikunv oguaingbv bvngdi kodu kubv?” Nikodemas tvvkato. “Hv lvkodv bvngdi kodu kubv vla anv gv namam lo aala nyuku mare!”<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>“Ngo jvjvbv nam mindunv,” Jisu mirwkto. “Yvvka Pwknvyarnv gv Karv lo vdwloka aanyu mare isi okv Darwknv Dow lokv bvnglin kuma dvdvlo. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Nyi v anvabu lokv bvngnam v nyi amarbv ridunv, vbvritola Darwknv Dow lokv bvngnam v dow bv ridunv. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Ngo gv nonu mvnwngnga kuu bvngdi kolaka vnam a no lamrwpamabvka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">lvkodv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">aolokv.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Doori v ogolo ridubv mvngdudw hoka ridu; nonu ho gv adua tvvpa nyumdo, vbvritola nonuno chima v ogo lokv aapvnvdw okv ogolo vngdu nvdw. Dow lo kuu bvngnam v mvnwng v ho apiabv ridunv.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nikodemas tvvkato, “Si oguaingbv rinyu dunv?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Jisu mirwkto, “No Israel gv kainv tamsar nvgobv ridu, vbvritola no sum chima dunvre? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Ngo jvjvbv nam mindunv: ngonu ogugo chindudw hum mindu okv ogugo kaadudw hum minpa jido, vbvritola nonuno yvvka ngonugv doin a naarwk sinv kaama. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Vdwlo ngo nyiamooku gv lvgabv nam minji renyi no nga tvjwngmanv; oguaingbv no tvjwng dukubv vdwlo ngo nyidomooku gv lvgabv nam minji rikunyi? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Nyia Kuunyilo nyidomooku tolokv inv mvngchik, ho lvvya yvvka nyidomooku ao tolo chaakwnv kaama.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:9">Num 21:9</ref> </char>
    </note> Chukrimooku lo Moses gv daachwng tabwa svngtung ao golo timpvto, vbvdvdvbv Nyia Kuunyilo ngamka aolo timpv rungre, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>vkvlvgabv yvv mvnwngngv ninyi mvngjwng rikudw v turbwngnv singnam a paare. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Pwknvyarnv nyiamooku a achialvbv pakla ninyigv Kuunyilo akin mvngchik a jitoku, vkvlvgabv yvvdw ninyia mvngjwng rinv v simare vbvritola turbwngnv singnam a paare. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Pwknvyarnv ninyigv Kuunyilo nga nyiamooku so gv nyi vdwa jwngkadaka yanv gubv imu ma, vbvritola ringyanv gubv imu pvnv.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Yvvdw Kuunyilo nga mvngjwng rekunv bunua jwngkadaka kumare; vbvritola yvbunudw mvngjwng marinv ho vdwa jwngkadaka roku, vkvlvgabv vbolo hv bunu Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo akin a mvngjwng kuma. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Jwngkadaka ngv svbv rireku: loung ngv nyiamooku so aatoku, vbvritola nyi vdwv loung nga kaiyabv kanv yanga mvngbiu yatoku, ogulvgavbolo bunugv rinam mvngnam v alvmatoku. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Yvvdw alvmanv nga ridunv hv loung nga kaanwng madunv, okv lounglo aamadunv, ogulvgavbolo ninyibunugv alvmabv rinam a kaatam nwngma dunv. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Vbvritola yvvdw jvjv rungnv nga ridunv, hv lounglo aadunv, ninyibunugv Pwknvyarnv gvlo mvnglwkkaalwk bv rinam a kaatam dubv vla.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Jon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>So kochingbv Jisu okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv Judia mookubv vngtoku, hoka bunua lvkobv achukgo relwk tvkula okv nyi vdwa baptisma naamu toku. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Hoka Jon ka Ainon nampum lo Salem vnam lokv adumako lo baptisma jidungla reto, ogulvgavbolo ho mooku hoka isi v kaigo dookunam lvgabv nyi vdwv Jon gvlo baptisma jiku dubv vla aatoku, hv bunua hoka baptisma jitoku. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mt 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Lk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note> So si Jonnyi patwk lvkma dwbv ripvnv.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Jon gv lvbwlaksu megonv darpudvbv sokbwngnam lvkwngbv Jius <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jius ako; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jius megonv.</char></note>nyi gonyi larmi surapto. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu Jon gvlo vngtoku okv minto, “Tamsarnv, no mvngpa dukudw Jordan takdv gv doonyi chaaku kyamgv nam lvkobv rinv nyi, okv yvvgv lvgabv no mindudw? Alvdo, hv nyi vdwa baptisma jiduku okv nyi mvnwngngv hvkv gvlo vngdung duku!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Jon mirwkto, “Yvvka ogugo doogv nyuma vdwlo Pwknvyarnv hum ninyi jima dvdvlo. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Jn 1:20</ref></char></note> Nonu ngoogv minam ha tvvnvkaanv pingko nyi vdwv, ngo minto ‘ngo Kristo ma, vbvritola ngam ninyia vngcho yamu pvnv.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Nyimv nyamjibongv paapum gvjinv gvbv ridu; vbvritola paapumgvjinvgv ajin v, dakdula tvrianv, himpu yadu vdwlo hv paapumgvjinvgv gaam a tvvpa rikudw. Svbv dvdvbv ngo atubogv mvngpuv punya dukunv. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Hv kaiyaya rungre, ngo miang yaya rungre.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hv Nyidomooku tolokv inv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Hv nyido mooku tolokv inv mvnwngnga kaiyadunv. Hv yvvdw Siching sokvdw Siching so gvbv ridunv okv Sichingmooku lvgabv mindu, vbvritola hv yvvdw nyido mooku tolokv idunv mvnwngnga kaiyanv. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>Hv minpado ogugo hv kaapvdw okv tvvpvdw, vbvrijvka yvvka ninyigv doin ha torwk sinv kaama. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Vbvritola yvvdw ninyigv doin ha naarwk sidunv hv Pwknvyarnv jvjv rungnv ngv vla chindu. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Yvvnyi Pwknvyarnv vngmu pvdw hv Pwknvyarnv gv gaam a mindu, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv ninyigv Darwknv Dow ha ninyi gvlo jinya chekala jito. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mt 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Lk 10:22</ref></char></note> Abu ninyigv Kuunyilo nga pakdu okv ogumvnwng nga ninyigv laak lo jilwk toku. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Yvvdw Kuunyilo nga mvngjwng dunv turbwngnv singnam ha paare; yvvdw Kuunyilo gv minam ha tvvma dunv hv singnam a paamare, vbvritola Pwknvyarnv gv mvritririt jiku arwng lo doore.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Samaritan nyimv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Parisi vdwv Jisu Jonnyi kaiyabv nyi naalwkla okv baptist jidu vla tvvpato. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>Minje jvbolo Jisu atuv yvvnyika baptisma jimato; ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv mvngchik jito. <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Vkvlvgabv vdwlo Jisu ogugo minpvdw tvvtoku, hv Judia nga vngyula okv Galili bv vngkur toku; <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>ninyigv vngku lamtv ngv Samaria bv vngpitla vngdubv rito.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 33:19">Atk 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Js 24:32</ref> </char>
    </note> Samaria lo Sikar vnam banggu lo hv aalwk toku, ho Jakop gv ninyigv kuu Josepnyi jinam rongo lokv adu mato. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Jakop gv isikua ngv hoka dooto, okv Jisu, moing vngkunamv anyu kuma toku, isi kua hoka dootungla doonu toku. Vbvrire hoka alu lopo bv rito.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Samaritan nyimv gonv isi mego tokdubv hoka aato, okv Jisu ninyia minto, “Nga isi tvngse go jilabv,” <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv dvnam rvvbv banggu lo vngyu roto.<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Ej 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 4:2">2</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">4:9 </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">Jius vdwv rinvmare kobu okv bati vdwv samaritan vdwgv rinvkunama </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Vmao </char>
      <char style="fqa" closed="false">Jius vdwv samaritan vdwa hogugoka rimisumadunv.</char>
    </note>Nyimv angv mirwksito, “No Jiu go, okv ngo Samaritan nyimv go—vkvlvgabv no oguaingbv nga tvngnamgu koodunv?” (Samaritan vdwgv dvnv tvngnvnv koobu okv bati vdwa Jius vdwv dvnv tvngnv madunv.)<verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Jisu mirwksito, “No Pwknvyarnv gv jinam a okv nam isi tvngse go koodudw ninyia chinv guilo, no ninyia koya dvnvpv, okv hv nam turgvnv isi a jiri nvpv.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Nyimv angv minto, “Tamsarnv, no isi toknvnv bvngma, okv isi kua ngv arwng chekwng do. Ogolo no turnvnv isi a paala dubv? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Si ngonugv abuapa Jakob gv ngonua isi kua jinammv; ninyi okv ninyigv kuunyilo, okv ninyigv sonam svnwngsvmin mvnwngngv soka tvngnya pvnv. No atuv Jakobnyi kaiyanv gubv minsu dunvre?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Yvvdw so gv isi a tvngdunv hv tvngnwng nwngkor reku, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Vbvritola yvvdw ngoogv isi jinam ha tvngdunv hv vdwloka tvngnwng nwngkor kumare, ngoogv ninyia isi jinammv ninyigv lvgabv isi boklin sinv aingbv rila ninyi singnam a turnam jinv isi gubv rire okv ninyi turbwngnv singnam a jire.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Nyimv angv ninyia minto, “Tamsarnv, ho isia ngam jilabvkv! vbvrikubolo ngo vdwloka tvngnwng mvngkor kuma dukubv, okv soka isi tokbv aakwng kuma dukubv.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “No vngyila no gv nyilua gokte kuka, okv aakur lakuka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Hv mirwkto, “Ngo nyilu guka kaama.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jisu mirwk sutoku, “Noogv ngo nyilu kaama vla minam v no jvjvbv mirungdo. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>No nyi angu go nyilubv mvtoku, okv noogv vjak lvkobv doogvnam nyi angvka noogv nyilu jvjvma. No nga jvjvbv minpa gvibv.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Nyimv angv minto, “Tamsarnv, ngo kaanam v no nyijwk go,” <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>“Ngoogv Samaritan abuapa vdwv Pwknvyarnvnyi so moodw so kumtojotoku, vbvritola nonu Jius vdwv Jerusalem v ngonugv Pwknvyarnvnyi kumjijojiku mooku v vla mindo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Nyimv, nga mvngjwng tvka, vkvnv aluv aariku nyi vdwv Abunyi so moodw sokaka kumnyajonya kumare vmalo Jerusalem loka kumnyajonya kumare. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Nonu Samaritan vdwv jvjv rungbv chima nonu yvvnyi kumdujodu nvdw; vbvritola ngonu Jius vdwv chindu ngonu yvvnyi kumdujodu nvdw, ogulvgavbolo so si Jius lokv ringlinbaalin v aadu. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Vbvritola aluv aariku okv vjak si doopv, Pwknvyarnv gv Dow gv jwkrw lokv nyi vdwv Abunyi jvjvbv kumlajola, ninyigv mvnglwk kaalwkbv kumrejoreku. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Pwknvyarnv Dowbv ridunv, okv yvv ninyia kumdujodunv hv jvjv rungbv okv dow bv kumlajola rirung sego.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Nyimv angv ninyia minto, “Ngo chindu Kristo aariku, okv vdwlo hv aarikudw, hv ogumvnwng nga ngonua minbwk jireku.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Jisu mirwk sutoku, “Hv dv ngo mabv, nam lvkobv raamisidunv.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Vbvrire hoka Jisu gv lvbwlaksu vdwv aakur toku, okv bunu ninyia nyimv gonyi raami sudubv kaala kairungbv lamrwpanya toku. Vbvritola bunugv lokv yvvka nyimv anga “No ogugo mvngdu?” Vla minv kaamato, vmalo Jisu nyika “No ogubv nyimv anga raami sudunv?” vla tvvka nvgoka kaamato.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Vbvrikunamv nyimv angv isi pvchwng nga kayupila, banggubv vngkur toku, okv hoka nyi vdwa mintoku, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Aato okv nyi anga kaakwto ngoogv ogugo rikunam mvnwngnga minpa nvgo. Kristo vnammv v bri?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu banggu a kayupila okv Jisu gvlo vngtoku.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Vbvridung rilo lvbwlaksu vdwv Jisunyi dinchi rungbv minto, “Tamsarnv, dvnam go dvlakv!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Vbvritola hv mirwkto, “Ngoogvlo nonugv chimanam dvnam v doodu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Vkvlvgabv lvbwlaksu vdwv bunugv aralo tvka minsunyato “Nyi gunv ninyia dvnamgu bvnglwk jipv nvgu bri?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Ngoogv dvnam hv Pwknvyarnv gv mvngkubv rinam angv nw ngam vngmunv okv ngo ninyigv rimidubv jinam ha rirungre. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Nonu mimbwng namgo doodu, ‘Poolu pwpi go doodvdu aam nvdwv’vla. Vbvritola ngo nonua mindunv, rongo nga alvbv kaatoka; rongo gv aam hv nginduku okv nvvdubv riduku! <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Yvvnyiv aam nvvpvdw nvvjo nga paadu okv turbwng gvnv dubv nvvchingla vvpvdu, ho hv lvvlwk nvla nvvchingnv lvkobv himpu pubam dubv vla. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>‘Nyi akonv lvvriare nyi akonv nvvching riare’ vnam si jvjv rungdo. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Ngo nonugv rongo nyingma kolo nonua aam nvdubv vngmuto; kvvbi vdwv hoka nyingdu okv nonuno boksi paayadu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Achialvnv Samaritan nyi vdwv Jisu nyi mvngjwng toku ogulvgavbolo nyimv angv minto, “Ngoogv ogumvnwng riku nama hv ngam minpa toku.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Vkvlvgabv vdwlo Samaritan vdwv hv golo aatokudw bunu ninyia dinchi rungbv minto bunua lvkobv dooming gvdubv, okv Jisu hoka alu lonyi go dootoku.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Achialv nyi go ninyia mvngjwng toku ninyigv doin a tvgvrila. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Okv bunu nyimv anga mintoku, “Ngonu vjak mvngjwng dukunv, noogv minam lokvma, ngonu atuv ninyi gvlo tvvnam lokv okv ngonu chinduku jvjvbv hv nyiamooku gv Ringnvbaanv gorung.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyigam ako gv kuunyilo nga mvpu jitoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Hoka alu lonyi go dooro kochingbv, Jisu vngraplaku okv Galili bv vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mt 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mk 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Lk 4:24</ref></char></note> Hv atubongv minsuto, “Nyijwk ka atubogv mooku lo mvngdv madunv.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Jn 2:23</ref></char></note>Vdwlo hv Galili lo vngchi tokudw, nyi vdwv ninyia alvrungbv aamu toku, ogulvgavbolo bunu Jerusalem lo vngbo pumja hoka vngtoku okv ho pumja hoka bunu ninyigv rinam mvnwngnga kaatoku.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Jn 2:1-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv Jisu Galili gv Kana nampum lo vngkur toku, ninyigv isi ha anggor ala bv mvku hoka. Sorkari nyigam go hoka dooto ninyigv kuunyilo ngv Kaparnaum lo lvvma toku. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Vdwlo hv Jisu Judia lokv Galili lo aapv vla tvvpa pvkudw, hv Jisu gvlo aala okv ninyia tvvkato Kaparnaum bv vngla ninyigv kuunyilo sida svngv bv rinv nga mvpu jilabv vla dinchi rungbv minto. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Nonu, yvvka mvngjwng mare vdwlo nonu kaasartabo okv lamrwpanam go kaama dvdvlo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Nyigam angv mirwkto, “Tamsarnv, nga lvkobv vngming gvcholabv ngoogv kuunyilo ngv sitv madvlo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Vngnyila, no gv kuunyilo ngv turriku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Nyi angv Jisu gv minam a mvngjwngto okv vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Ninyigv nampum lamtv hoka ninyigv pakbu vdwv ninyia kaarwksula yunying nga gvjito, “No gv kuunyilo ngv turduku!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Hv bunua tvvkato vdwlola ninyigv kuunyilo ngv alvyakunamv, okv bunu mirwkto, “Doonyi hv chaanyala tabv rilo tamiramhv ninyia liu toku.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Vbvrikunamv abu angv mvngpa toku, ho dw lo Jisu gv ninyia “No gv kuunyilo ngv turriku,” vla mindwbv ritoku. Vkvlvgabv hv la okv ninyigv nyimv kuu vdwv mvngjwng nyatoku.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Judia lokv Galili bv aaro kochingbv si Jisu lvnyi naabv lamrwpadubv rila kaatam namv.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Svpar pargo lo nyi mvpu kunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>So kochingbv, Jisu dormo pumja lvgabv Jerusalem bv vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Jerusalem gv svlar agi nvchilo svpar pargo dooto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Svlar Agi nvchilo svpar pargo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Svlar Svpar nvchilo dooku go.</char></note> taabio angu goka dooto; Hebru gaam bv um Betjata vla minto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Betjata; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kiap lo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Betesda.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Lvvmanv nyipam go taabio lo karpv nyato—nyikchingnv, lvpiknv, okv digwngnv. Bunu isi gv binam a kayala dooto,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo bars 3-4 sum lvkpwngdo: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Bunu isi v biridw vla kaaya nyato, </char><char style="fv">4</char> ogulvgavbolo lvko lvkbv Ahtu gv nyidogindung ila svpar gv isia bidubv mvto. Isi gv birinyi yvv svpar lo aacho pvdw ogunv lvvmabv rijvka hv pooya toku.</note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>ogulvgavbolo nyido gindung ngv idw dwkibv ila isi a bidubv mvto. Vbv isi v birap rinyi yvvdw hoka poklwk chodunv hv ogugo lvvma go gvpvdw poya dukunv. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Hoka nyi ako anying chaam gola nyingpinw go lvvmala doonvgo dooto. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Jisu nyi anga hoka doodubv kaatoku, okv hv chintoku nyi angv vkvjegu kaibv lvvmala doopv nvgo vla; vkvlvgabv hv ninyia tvvkato, “No chvrv kunvpv mvngdure?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Lvvmanv nyi angv mirwksito, “Tamsarnv, vdwlo svpar bolokv isi v birinyi ngam bolo dvlwk jinv nyi go doyama; vdwlo ngo gilwk dubv ritv rinyi, nyigonv gilwk choyado.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Gudung tokuka, noogv doopikarpi nvnv nga naarap tokuka, okv vngkar tokuka.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Vjakgobv nyi angv alvtoku; hv ninyigv karpi nvnv nga naarap toku okv vngkar raptoku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Vbvriri aluv Jius Doonualu bv ritoku, <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char></note> Vkvlvgabv Jius nyi rigvnv vdwv poyakunv nyi anga mintoku, “Silu Jius Doonualuv, okv noogv karpiu nvnv nga baknam si ngonugv Pvbv nga rinying do.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Hv mirwkto, “Ngam mvpunv nyi angv ngam karpiu nvnv nga naarapla vngto kuka vla minto.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Bunu ninyia tvvkato, “Nam sum ritokv vla minv nyi angv yvvla?”<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Vbvritola mvpunam nyi angv Jisu yvvdw um chimato, hoka nyi nyipam go dooto, okv Jisu nyipam lokv vnglintoku.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Ayungjvma nga, Jisu nyi anga Pwknvyarnvnaam lo kaapa toku okv minto, “Tvvtoka, no alvrungpvku; vkvlvgabv rimur kumabvka vmalo alvmanv ngv nam rijila.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Vbvrikunamv nyi angv vngtoku okv Jius nyi rigvnv vdwa minpa toku ninyia mvpunv nyi angv Jisu kv vla. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu Jisunyi alvmabv rirap toku, ogulvgavbolo bunugv Jius Doonualu lo hv nyi anga mvpu jinam lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Ngoogv Abu alu lokia nyingdunv, okv ngooka nyingrung jinv.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>So minam si Jius nyi vdwa kaiyayabv ninyia mvkidubv mvngmuto; Jius doonualu gv Pvbv nga mvyakmvchak mvngma, vbvritola hv minto Pwknvyarnvnyi atugv Abu vkv okv svbv hv atuv Pwknvyarnvnyi karingching dubv minsuto.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuunyilo gv Tujupkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunua mirwksito, “Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidu: Kuunyilo ngv hv atuv oguguka rinyuma; hv ninyigv Abu gv rinam a kaagvrila rimwngdunv. Abu ogugo ridudw, Kuunyilo ngvka ridu. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Abu Kuunyilo nga pakdu okv ninyia ninyigv rinam mvnwngnga kaatamdu. Hv ninyia sum kaiyabv ridubv, okv nonu mvnwngngv mvngngak reku. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Abu gv nyi sinv nga turkur moduku okv singnam a bunua jidu, vkv apiabv Kuunyilo ngvka ninyigv mvngkubv bunua singnam a jidu. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Abu yvvnyika jwngkadaka madu. Hv ninyigv Kuunyilo nga ogumvnwng nga jwngkadaka dubv jito, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>Abunyi mvnwngngv mvngdvnam aingbv, Kuunyilo ngaaka mvngdv dubv. Yvvdw Kuunyilo nga mvngdv madunv hv ninyia vngmunv Abu nyika mvngdv madunv.”<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: yvvdw ngoogv gaam ha tvvdunv okv ngam imu nvnyi mvngjwng dunv hv torbwngnama paariku. Hv jwngkadaka lo domare ogulvgavbolo hv sinam loka vngbola turnamlo aapv kunv. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: dw ngv aadungduku—dw ngv aaropvku—vdwlo sinv vdwv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo gv gaam a tvvpare, okv yvvbunudw um tvvpa rinv hv turnamlo aariku. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Abunyi atuv turnam gv kolv ngv, vbvdvdvbv ninyigv Kuunyilo nga turnam gv kolv gubv mvpvkunv. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Hv Kuunyilo gvbv alvpoma nga jwngkadaka nvnv ngaaka jipv, ogulvgavrinyi hv Nyia Kuunyilo ngv. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Nonu sum lamrwpagv mabvka, sinv mvnwngngv ninyigv gaam a tvvpadwv aariku <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note>okv bunugv nyibung vdwlokv linreku: yvvbunudw alvbv rikunv vdwv gudungla okv turreku, okv yvvbunudw alvmanv nga rikunv vdwv gudungre okv darra koore.”<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv lvkwngbv minjinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Ngo atuv oguguka rinyuma, Pwknvyarnv gv minam mvngchik a ngo makardu, vkvlvgabv ngoogv makarnamv jvjvdu, ogulvgavbolo ngo atuv alvnam lvgabv ritvma, vbvritola ngam vngmunv mvngchik gv mvnggiabv rijire.”<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Ngo ngo atubogv lvkwngbv minjidunv bolo, ogugo mindudw hv torwk sunam jvjv gubv rilin jimare. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Vbvritola ngoogv lvkwng nga minji nvgo akin go doodu okv ngo chindu hv ogugo ngo lvkwngbv minam dvdv ngv jvjvngv. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Jn 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note> Jon ho angv yvv gvlo nonu nonugv gindungpingko nga vngmu pvdw, okv hv jvjvgv lvkwng nga japjito. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>So si vbvma, ngo nyi mirianv ako doodu vla, ngo sum mimwngdunv nonua ringnam vdwa paamu dubv. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Jon mvru aingbv rito, guto okv ungkato, okv nonu ninyigv lounglo dw achukgo himpu karnvpv vla mvngdungto. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Vbvritola ngo atubogv lokv minse risego doodu so si Jon gv minam vdwaka kaiyanv go: ngo ogugo ridudw, ho hv, ngo Abu gv ngam ridubv jinammv so vdw si ngogvbv miriadu okv Abu ngam vngmupvnv vla kaatamdu. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Lk 3:22</ref></char></note> Okv Abu, yvvdw ngam vngmunv, ngoogv lvkwng ngaaka minjidu. Nonu ninyigv gaam ha vdwloka tvvkwma vmalo ninyigv nyukmu aka kaakwma, <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>okv nonu ninyigv doin a nonugv haapok lo vvpvma, okv nonu nw gv vngmunam angaka mvngjwngma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Nonu Darwknv Kitap vdwa puri rido, ogulvgavbolo nonu mvngdo bunu gvlo turbwng nama paare vla. Okv si Darwknv Kitaplo ngoogv lvkwngbv mindu! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Vbvrijvka nonuno turnam paanam lvgabv ngoogvlo aanvpv vla mvngma.”<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Ngo nyia vdwgv hartvnama makar madunv. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Vbvritola ngo chindu nonu oguaingnv nyi gudw, okv ngo chindu nonugv haapok lo Pwknvyarnv gv lvgabv aya namgo dooma. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Ngo Abu gv jwkrw ha lvkobv aagv pvnv, vbvritola nonuno nga torwk suma; vdwlo, vbvrijvka, kvvbi akonv ninyigv atugv jwkrw ha lvkobv aagv nama, nonu um torwk sure. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Nonu akonv akonvnga hartv minsu nama mvngbiu do, vbvritola nonu Pwknvyarnv akin mvngchik lokv hartvnama paanvpv vla rikwma; vbvrikunamv, oguaingbv nonu nga mvngjwng nyudubv? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Vbvrijvka, mvngma bvka, Pwknvyarnv gvlo ngo nonua gungnying lwkji bongv vla. Moses nonugv mvnggingla dvmin kunam, hv nonua gungnying lwkji bongv. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Nonuno Mosesnyi jvjvbv mvngjwng doonv guilo, nonu ngaaka mvngjwng doore, ogulvgavbolo hv ngoogv lvkwngbv lvkpvto. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Vbvritola hv ogugo lvkpvdw um nonuno mvngjwng manv ngv, oguaingbv ngoogv minam a nonu mvngjwng nyudubv?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu hejar angu nyi vdwa dvnam dvmu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mt 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Lk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>So kochingbv, Jisu Galili Svpar vmalo, Tiberias Svpar vlaka minam a vngbola vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Nyi nyipam twngtv nvgo ninyia vngming gvto, ogulvgavbolo bunu ninyigv lvvmanv vdwa lamrwpadubv mvpuripu nama kaatoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Jisu moodw gulo chaatoku okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv dootung toku. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Vngbokunam Pumja ridw v nvchi toku. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Jisu kaitkarla kaato okv nyipam v nw gvlo aadungdubv kaapato, vkvlvgabv nw Pilipnyi tvvkato, “Ngonu so nyi vdw sum dvgu dubv dvmunam lvgabv ogolo dvnam rvvpa nyuredw?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Hv svbv minam si Pilipnyi tvvka rungbv minto; minjvjvbolo hv chincho suto ogugo hv rise ngvdw.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Pilip mirwkto, “Nyichar mvnwngnga achukgo dvmu dajvka, so si lokdwng lvngnyi go <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">silver coins: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A silver coin was the daily wage of a rural worker (see Mt 20.2).</char></note>dinchirungre dvgudvbv dvnam rvvdubv.”<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu akonv, Andriu, Saimon Pitar gv boru bv rinv, angv minto, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Olo vka vmi ako vtwng tangu go okv ngui nvnyi go gvnvgo doopv. Vbvritola hv so nyi mvnwng gv lvgabv chirung mare.”<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Nyi vdwa dootung dubv mvtoka,” (Hoka achialvgo nvmwng ngv dooto.) Vkvlvgabv nyi mvnwngngv dootung nyatoku; hoka ho nyiga dvdv ngv hejar angu gubv ritoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Jisu vtwng nga naato, okv Pwknvyarnvnyi umbonyikv vto, okv hoka doonv nyi vdwa ortoku. Nw ngui haka vbvdvdvbv mvto, okv bunu mvnwngngv vdwgo dvla pvkudw dvgubv dubv dvtoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Vdwlo bunu mvnwngngv dvji dubv dvto kudw, nw ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Dvlv nga naakumto; akoka ornam orsubv ora momabvju.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu vtwng tangu nyi vdwgv dvkunam lokv dvtung dvngo dvlv mvnwngnga paapi vring gola anyigo naakum toku.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Jisu gv svbv lamrwpanam rila kaatam nama kaala hoka nyi vdwv minto, “So si jvjvbv Nyijwk gurung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">silver coins: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A silver coin was the daily wage of a rural worker (see Mt 20.2).</char></note> Sichingmooku so aakujinv akonv!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Bunu ninyia naatungla Dvbv bv mvlilala tvdu vla Jisu chintoku; vkvlvgabv nw atubongv moodw vdwbv vngyu toku.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu isi aolo vngkar toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mt 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Vdwlo arium tokudw, Jisu gv lvbwlaksu vdwv svpar lo ilwk toku, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>svpw gulo aalwk toku, okv svpar lo Kaparnaum kiambv vngkorla vngtoku. Arium kanv toku, okv Jisu vjaklodvbv bunu gvlo aatv madvto. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Vbvrikunamv kainv doori go rilwkto okv isi a kiokdubv mvtoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Lwbwlaksu vdwv svpwa dula lvtw angu vmalo akv gubv dulwk toku vdwlo bunu Jisunyi isi aolo vngdung dubv, svpw nvchilo aadung dubv kaapa toku, okv bunu busu nyatoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Nonuno busu mabvka, si ngo sumabv!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu mvngpula ninyia svpw arwnglo aamu toku okv svpw lo bunugv vnglwkjiku mooku lo baapubv vngchi nyatoku.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi vdwv Jisunyi makar nyatoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Logo nvnga nyipam v svpar takdv gonvbv doonv vdwv oloka svpw ngv akin gumwng vla mvngdi nyatoku. Bunu Jisunyi ninyigv lvbwlaksu lvkobv vngma, vbvritola bunu ninyia kayupila vngyu ropvku vla chintoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Kvvbi svpw vdwv, Tiberias lokv, Jisu gv vtwng nga umbonyikv vro kochingbv nyi vdwa dvmuku mooku nvchi gv isi adarlo aakum nyatoku. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Vdwlo nyipam v Jisu hoka dooma, ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwvka dooma vla kaato kudw, bunu ho svpw vdw ho aanyatoku okv ninyia kaakarla Kaparnaumbv vngtoku.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu turnam gv vtwng ngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Vdwlo nyi vdwv Jisunyi svpar gv takdv gunvlo kaapa tokudw, bunu ninyia tvvkato, “Tamsarnv, vdwlo no so aapvnv?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngo nonua jvjv nga minpa jidunv: nonuno ngam makardu ogulvgavbolo nonu vtwng nga dvla okv nonugv mvngnam a dvkunam lvgalo, ngoogv lamrwpanam rinam a chinam lokvma. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Alvmanv gubv rijinv dvnam lvgabv rima bvka, vmabvya turbwngla svngya jinv dvnam lvgabv rilaka. So siinv Nyia Kuunyilo gv nonua dvnam jiji namv, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv Abu ninyia alvnvgobv tolwk laku mvu pvkunv.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu ninyia tvvkato, “Pwknvyarnv gv mvnglwkbv rinam lvgabv ngonu ogugo rila sego bri?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Pwknvyarnv gv nonua ritokv vla mvngnamv si ninyigv vngmunam anga mvngjwng laka vla.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Bunu mirwksito, “Ogu lamrwpanam go no rila kaatam dubv ngonu um kaagvrila nam mvngjwng dubv? No ogugo ridubv? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Mog 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Miri 78:24</ref> </char></note> Ngonugv abuapa vdwv chukrimooku lo manna nga dvto Darwknv Kitaplo minam aingbv, ‘Hv nyido mooku tolokv vtwng nga jito dvmu dubv.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>“Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv,” Jisu minto, “Moses nonua ogugo jipv kudw hv nyidomooku tolokv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:32 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nonua Moses hogugo jinamv v mayi; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nonua jinv angv hv Moses ma</char></note> vtwng ma; so si ngoogv Abu nonua nyidomooku tolokv vtwng loda jenga jinv. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Pwknvyarnv gv vtwng jinammv hv yvvdw nyidomooku tolokv inv okv nyiamookua turnam jidu.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Bunu ninyia kooto, “Tamsarnv, so gv dvnam a ngonua lokia jilabv.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Jisu bunua mintoku, “Ngo kunv turnam gv vtwng ngv, yvvdw ngoogvlo aadunv vdwloka kano kumare; yvvdw ngam mvngjwng dunv vdwloka tvngnwng kumare. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Vjak, ngo nonua mindunv nonuno ngam kaaroku vbvritola mvngjwng mare. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Nyichar mvnwngnga yvvnyi ngo Abu ngam jidu kudw ngogvlo aareku. Ngo vdwloka ngogvlo aanv nga dakkurla vngyu mare, <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>ogulvgavbolo ngo nyidomooku tolokv inam hv ngo atugv mvngwngbv ridu bvma vbvritola ngam vngmunv ninyigv mvngnambv ridubv. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Okv so si ngam vngmunv ninyigv mvngnamv ngo ninyigv jinam mvnwng loka akonyika ngoomu marung dubv, vbvritola ngo bunua ataranya alulo bunua turrap modukubv. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ngo Abu gv mvngnam v Kuunyilo nga kaanv mvnwngngv okv ninyia mvngjwngnv vdwv turbwngnv singnam ha paadubv. Okv ngo bunua ataranya alu lo turmu dukubv.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Nyi vdwv ninyia bvdung-bvdungbv japnyato, ogulvgavbolo hv minto “Ngo nyidomooku tolokv vtwng inv ngv.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Vkvlvgabv bunu minto, “So nyi si Jisu, Josep gv kuunyilo ngv, hv mari? Ngonu ninyigv abu nyila okv anvnyi chindu, vbvrikunamv vjak oguaingbv hv mindunvdw ngo nyidomooku tolokv ipvnv vla?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Nonugv pingkolo bvdung-bvdungbv mimabvka. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Yvvka ngoogvlo aanyu mare vdwlo ngam vngmunv Abu ninyia ngoogvlo naalwk jima redw; okv ngo ninyia ataranya alulo turrap moreku. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Aij 54:13</ref></char></note> Nyijwk vdwv lwkgapto, ‘Mvnwngnga Pwknvyarnv tamsarto.’ Yvvdw Abunyi tvvgap dunv okv ninyi gvlo chindunv ngoogvlo aadunv. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>So si vbv minam angvma nyi gunv Abunyi kaapv nvgo vla; hv yvvdw Pwknvyarnv lokv aapvnv hv mvngchik Pwknvyarnvnyi kaanv ngv. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: yvvdw mvngjwng dunv hv turbwngnv singnam a paapv kunv. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Ngo kunv turnam gv vtwng ngv. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Nonugv abuapa vdwv chukrimooku lo manna nga dvto, vbvritola bunu siroku. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Vbvritola nyidomooku tolokv inv vtwng ngv vbvridu um dvnv ngv simare. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Ngo turnv vtwng ngv nyidomooku tolokv ipvnv. Yvvdw so vtwng sum dvbolo, hv turbwngla singre. Ngoogv ninyia vtwng jiji namv ngoogv ayak v um ngo jidu ogulvgavbolo nyiamooku hv singdu kubv.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Si bunugv apumlo haachila larrap minsunam gubv rito. Bunu tvvka minsuto, “Oguaingbv so nyi si ninyigv ayakka ngonua dvmudubv vla jila nyuridw?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Ngo jvjv nga nonua minjidunv: nonu vdwlo nyia Kuunyilo gv ayakka dvma redw okv ninyigv oyi ha tvngma redw nonu atubongv turnama paamare. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Yvvdw ngoogv ayakka dvridw okv ngoogv oyi ha tvngridw turbwngnv singnam ha paare, okv ataranya alulo ngo ninyia turrap moriku. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ogulvgavbolo ngoogv ayak v dvnam jvjv ngv; ngoogv oyi si tvngnam jvjv ngv. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Yvvdw ngoogv ayak ha dvdunv okv ngoogv oyi ha tvngdunv ngoogvlo doodunv, okv ngo ninyi gvlo doodunv. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Turbwngnv Abu ngam vngmuto, okv ninyigv lokv ngo ka turdunv. Ho apaiabv yvvdw ngoogv ayak ha dvdunv hv ngo gvlokv turbwngla doore. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Vbvrikunamv, si, nyidomooku tolokv inv vtwng ngv; so si nonugv abuapa vdwgv vtwng dvnam aingma, vbvritola koching so sitoku. Yvvdw so vtwng sung dvredw hv turbwngla svngre.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Jisu sum Kaparnaum lo Jius kumkunaamlo ninyigv tamsar sarnam jvbv minto.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Turbwngla singnam gv Gamchar vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Ninyigv rigvnam nyi achialvgo sum tvvpa toku okv minto, “So tamsarnam si achialvbv rinyu manamgo. Yvv sum tvvria nyudubv?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Minpanvgo kaamajeka, Jisu chinto bunu soogv lvga nga bvdung-bvdungbv larmisidu nvgo vla vkvlvgabv hv bunua minto, “So si nonua topu monwng dubv mvdu nvgo lare? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Vbvrikunamv, nonu nyia Kuunyilo nga ninyigv kvvlo doochoku mooku tolo chaakor dukubv kaanam gubv rikubolo? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Turnam ogugo jinv si Pwknvyarnv gv Dow ngv; nyi gv jwkrw si vdwloka ogu mvnwng loka rinv nyuma. Ngoogv nonua gamchar minam vdwv turnam naalwk jinv Pwknvyarnv gv Dow ngv. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Vbvritola nonu megonv mvngjwngma.” (Jisu atoklokv chinchoto bunugv lokv yvvdw mvngjwng majinv okv yvvdw ninyia koa kujinv.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Okv hv mindvto, “So siinv anyung ngv ngo nonua mintoku vdwlo Abu ninyia vbv rinyu dubv mvvma dvdvlo yvvka ngoogvlo aanyu mare.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Vbv minam lvkwngbv, Jisu gv rigvnam achialvgo vngkur nyatoku okv ninyia lvkoka vngming gvkuma. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Vkvlvgabv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi vdwa tvvkato, “Okv nonu—nonu ka topu duku bri?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:68,69: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mt 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mk 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Lk 9:20</ref></char>
    </note>Saimon Pitar ninyia mirwksito, “Ahtu vbvbolo ngonu yvvnyi vngming gvdu kubv? Turbwngnv singnam a jinv gamchar v no gvlo doodu. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Okv ngonu vjak mvngjwngdu okv chindu no darwk mvngchiknv Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aanv.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngo nonu vring gola anyia darpvnv, ngo darmare? Vbvritola nonugv lokv akonv uyudvbv go!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Hv Judas gv lvkwng nga minto, Saimon Iskeriot gv kuunyilo. Judas, lvbwlaksu vring gola anyi lokv jeka, Jisunyi koa tvduku.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv ninyigv boru vdwv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>So kochingbv, Jisu Galili bv vngkarto; hv Judia lo vngkar nwngma toku, ogulvgavbolo Jius nyi kainv vdwv hoka ninyia mvki dubv mvngnyato. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Leb 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Det 16:13</ref> </char></note> Rongonampo pumja ridwv nvchi toku, <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>vkvlvgabv Jisu gv boru vdwv ninyia minto, “So mooku sam kayupila okv Judia bv vngtoka, ogulvgavbolo nam reming gvnv nyi vdwv no ogugo ridudw kaamu dubv. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Hv ogugo ridudw alvrungbv chimu nvpv mvngbolo yvvka vvsi mare. No sung ridung roku, nyiamooku gv nyi mvnwngnga nam chimu toka!” <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Ninyigv boru vdwvka ninyia mvngjwng mato.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Ngoogv lvgabv alvnv dw hv aatv madv. Nonugv lvgabv ogu dw jvka alvnv. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Nyiamooku gv nyi vdwv nonua kaanwng mabv rinyu mare, vbvritola bunu nga kaanwng mado, ogulvgavbolo bunugv lamtv ngv alvma vla ngo bunua minbwng jido. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Nonu pumja lo vngsu laka, ngo so gv pumja so vngmare,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngo vngmare; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vjakka ngo vngmadv.</char></note> ogulvgavbolo ngoogv lvgabv alvnv dw v aatv madv.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Hv sum mintoku, okv vbvrikunamv Galili lo doobwngla doolwk toku.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu rongonampo pumja golo dootoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>Ninyigv boru vdwgv pumja lo vngro kochingbv, Jisu ka vngtoku; vbvrijvka hv nyi mvnwngnga kaapatapa dubv vngmato, vbvritola choibv vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Jius nyi kainv vdwv ninyia pumja lo kaakarnyato. “Hv ogolobvri?” bunu tvvka toku.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Hoka ninyigv lvkwng nga nyipamlo achialvbv japsijapit nyato. “Hv alvnv nyi go,” Nyi megonv minto. Kvvbi vdwv minto “Ma, hv nyi vdwa rimur gvdu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Vbvritola yvv akonvka ninyigv lvgabv japkok rikok mato, ogulvgavbolo bunu Jius nyi kainv vdwa busu nyato.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Pumja nga tunggo nvnga rinya toku vdwlo Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngla hoka tamsar sarrap tokudw. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Jius nyi kainv vdwv achialvbv lamrwpanya toku okv minto, “Hv ogu risarrima kolo vngkw rikw magvre, oguaingbv hv vkv nvgu achialvbv chimpv nvdw?”<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngo ogugo tamsar dvdw hv ngo atubogv tamsar sarnamma, vbvritola hv nga vngmunv Pwknvyarnv lokv aadunv. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gv mvngnambv rinwng nvngv chinre ngo ogugo tamsar dvdw, Pwknvyarnv lokv aadu nvdw vmalo ngo atubogv chinampaanam lokv mindunvdw. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Yvvdw atubogv chinampaanam lokv mindunv, hv atubonga kaibv yungku dubv mvsudunv. Vbvritola yvvdw ninyia vngmunv lvgabv kaibv yungnamma mvngdunv, hv alvnv, okv hoka ninyigv ogu mvvnamrunam kaama. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Moses nonua Pvbv nga jito, hv jima pvnvri? Vbvritola nonuno yvvka Pvbv nga tvnvrinv kaama. Ogulvgabv nonu nga mvki dubv rikw dunv?”<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Nyipam hv mirwkto, “No arwnglo uyuvram gvdu nvgo! Nam yvvla mvki dubv rikw nvngv?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngo lamrwpanam go kaatamto okv nonu mvnwngngv lamnyato. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leb 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Atk 17:10</ref></char></note>Moses nonua orto jito nonugv kuunyilo vdwa ayakmvu dubv (so si Moses ma vbvritola nonugv abuapa vdwv sum rirap gvtoku), okv vkvlvgabv nonuno kuunyilo nga Jius Doonualu lo ayakmvu dunv. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Jn 5:9</ref> </char></note> Vminyilo nga Jius Doonualu lo ayakmvu dunvlo vkvlvgabv Moses gv Pvbv ngv mvwk madubv, ogulvgavbolo ngoogv nyi nga Jius doonualu lo mvnwngnga alvdukubv mvnam a haachi dunv? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Agum lokv kaala jwngnamdanam a kayu tokuka, okv jvjv lokv jwngkadaka laka.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hv rungre Kristo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Jerusalem gv nyi megonv minto, “So nyi si mare kainv vdwgv mvki nvpvkv vnam angv? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Kaatoka! Hv kvba vdwlo japdungdo, okv bunu ninyia oguka minyingminsu ma! hv bunugv si Kristo vla chimbwk kunam guma bri? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Vbvritola vdwlo Kristo aarikudw, yvvka chimare hv ogo lokvdw: okv ngonu mvnwngngv chindu so nyi si ogo lokvdw.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo japtoku, hv gamtv rungbv minto, “Nonu ngam jvjvbv chimpvi okv ogolokvbvri vla chimpvi? Ngo atubongv aasuma, ngam vngmunv angv jvjv ngv. Nonu ninyia chima, <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>vbvritola ngo ninyia chindu, ogulvgavbolo ngo ninyigv lokv aapvnv okv hv nga vngmupvnv.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyia naatung tvvto, vbvritola yvvka ninyia laak laklin nvgoka kaamato, ogulvgavbolo ninyigv alvnv dw ngv aatvmadvto. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Vbvritola nyipamlo nyi achialvgo ninyia mvngjwng nyato okv minto, “Vdwlo Kristo aarikudw, hv so nyi sum kaiyabv lamrwpanam rila kaatam rekudw?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi naatung dubv sipai vdwa vngmu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Parisis vdwv nyipamlo Jisu gv lvgabv japsijapit dubv tvvpa toku, vkvlvgabv bunu okv nyibu butvnv vdwv sipai mego ninyia naatung dubv vngmutoku. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Jisu minto “Ngo achukgo asu dubv nonua lvkobv doore, okv vbvrikunamv ngo ngam vngmunv gvlo vngyu reku. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Nonu ngam kaakarre vbvritola nonu ngam kaapamare, ogulvgavbolo ngo ogolo dooridw nonu vngnyu mare.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Jius nyi kainv vdwv bunu atubongv minsunyato, “Ngonu ninyia mapa madubv hv ogolobvri vngtv tvdunv? Hv Grik pamtv vdwlo ngonugv nyi rikulo vngla Grik vdwa tamsar tvdu nvbvri? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Hv mindu ngonu ninyia kaakarre vbvritola kaaapa mare vla, okv hv ogolo dooridw ngonu hoka vngnyu mare vla. Ninyigv minam si ogu gobvre?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Turnam jinv Isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Leb 23:36</ref> </char>
    </note> Pumja alu gv lootar loonya dinchi yachoknv alu lo Jisu dakrapto okv gamtv rungbv minto, “Yvvla tvngnwng dunv ngoogvlo aarung laka okv tvnglaka. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eje 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Jek 14:8</ref> </char></note>Darwknv Kitaplo mindu, ‘Yvvdw nga mvngjwng dunv, singnamlo turnam jinv isi svdwng dvngdo ngv ninyigv haapok lokv pwlin jire.’”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jisu gv gamchar vdwv bars 37-38 lvkdin lare: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">“Yvvdw tvngnwng dunv ngoogvlo aarung laka okv tvnglaka. </char><char style="fv">38</char> Darwknv kitap lo minam aingbv, ‘Yvvdw ngam mvngjwng ridw ninyigvlo turnam gv isi v bilinre.’”</note> <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Jisu gv so minam si Dow gv lvgabv minto, yvvbunudw ninyia mvngjwng rinv hv bunu paatv rinv. Ho dw lo Dow a jitv madvto, ogulvgavbolo Jisu vjaklodvbv sila turkurla yunglitnam gubv ritv madvto.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyi vdwv apinain sunyato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Nyipam lokv nyi megonv ninyia vbv mindubv tvgvrila minto, “So nyi si jvjvrungbv Nyijwk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Nyijwk go: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaatoka 1.21.</char></note> go!”<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Kvvbi vdwv minto, “Hv kunv Kristo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Vbvritola kvvbi gunv kuring minto “Kristo Galili lokv linmare! <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Darwknv Kitaplo mindu Kristo Dvbv Dabid gv husi lokv linre vla okv Betlehem lo bvnglinre, Dabid gv dooku banggu lo.” <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Vkvlvgabv hoka nyi vdwv asak-asak sutoku Jisu gv lvkwnglo. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Megonv ninyia naatung dubv mvngtoku vbvritola yvvka ninyi laak laklin nvgoka kaama toku.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jius nyi tujupkunam vdwgv mvngjwng manam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Vdwlo sipai vdwv vngkur tokudw, nyibu butvnv vdwv okv parisis vdwv bunua tvvkato, “Nonu ogubv ninyia aagv mapvnv?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Sipai vdwv mirwkto, “Yvvka alo nyi vbv minv kaama!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Parisis vdwv bunua tvvkato, “Hv nonua pvcha dubv mvta pvnvre? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>Vdwloka no kainv nyi akoka okv Parisis goka ninyia mvngjwng dubv chimpvnvre? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>So nyipam si Moses gv Pvbv nga chima, vkvlvgabv bunu Pwknvyarnv gv beenam arwnglo doodunv!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref> </char>
    </note>Parisis akin go hoka Nikodemas, yvvdw kvvlo Jisunyi kaabv vngnv nyi angv. Hv kvvbi vdwa minto, <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Ngonugv Pvbv gv milam lokv vngrinyi ngonu yvvnyika rimur vngmur ha gaklin madvbv mia jinyuma.”<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Bunu mirwkto, “Alvpv,” “No ka Galili lokvre? Darwknv Kitap a puri kaateka okv Galili lokv nyijwk aanv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nyijwk go aakwma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitap akonv golo vbv doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nyijwk v aamare.</char></note> kaama vla no chinre.”<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Rimurnv nyimv go naatungnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Vbvrikunamv nyichar mvnwngngv naam bv vngnya toku, vbvritola Jisu Olib Moodw bv chaatoku. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Alu logonvgv arukamchibv nw Pwknvyarnvnaam bv vngkur toku. Nyi mvnwngngv vngkumla ninyia vngyumto, okv nw dootung tvvla bunua tamsar sarrap toku. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Pvbv tamsarnv vdwv okv Parisis vdwv nyimv ako yoomur nvgo naatungla boolwk nyato, okv bunu nyimv nvnga mvnwng gv kaagialo dakmuto. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Bunu Jisunyi minto, “Tamsarnv, so nyimv angv yoomurla rila donv nga naatung pvnv. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Leb 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Det 22:22-24</ref></char></note>Ngonugv Pvbv lo Moses gamkito svkvnv nyimv nga vlwngngv orkidubv. Vjak, no ogu vla mindunv?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Bunugv svbv minam si Jisunyi minkup gvrila gungnying lwkdubv vla minto. Vbvritola hv dumpo bawng gvrila ninyigv lakching lokv kvdwlo akor lvkminla dooyasuto.<verse eid="JHN 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Bunu hoka daktola ninyia tvula tvvka dvdvnyato, hv mvngrwpala yikula baarapla bunua minto, “Nonu gv lokv akonv yvvla rimur rima pvnv hv ninyia vlwng orcholaka.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Vbvrikunamv nw lvkodv dumpo bawng gvrila kvdw lo lvkminto. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Vdwlo bunu sum tvvtokudw, bunu abwngyachok v vngcho gvlaila akin akinbv mvnwngngv vngyu nyatoku. Jisunyi akin dookubv okv nyimv nvngaka hoka dakbwng dubv bunu vngyu nyatoku. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Hv atubongv mvngrw laila baarapla nyimv anga tvvkato, “Ogolo bunu? Nam miakaya jinv akoka dooku mai?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Nw mirwksito, “Tamsarnv,” akoka dookuma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Vbvrikunamv, alvdo, Jisu minto, “Ngo ka nam miakaya madunv. Vngnyikuka, vbvritola lvkodv rimur kumabvka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Achialv kitap vdwo okv lvkdin kunam vdwlo so abor (8:1-11) si doomado; kvvbi vdwv Jn 7:36 gv kochingo doodu; kvvbi gunv kure Lk 21:38 gv kochinglo doodu; kitap akin gulo Jn 7:36 gv kochinglo doodu.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyiamooku gv loung ngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Jisu Parisis vdwa lvkodv mindvto. Nw minto, “Ngo nyiamooku gv loung ngv, yvvdw nga vngming gvdunv hv singnamlo loung yayabv rire okv vdwloka kanv arwnglo vngkar mare.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 5:31">Jn 5:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Parisis vdwv ninyia minto, “Vjak no atubogv lvgabv minsudo; no ogugo mindudw anyung kaama.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ma, ngo atubogv lvkwng nga minsu jvka, ngo ogugo mindudw hv jvjv ngv, ogulvgavbolo ngo chinsudo ngo ogolokv aapvnvdw okv ngo ogolo vngtv tvdunvdw. Nonu chima ngo ogolokv aapvnvdw vmalo ngo ogolo vngtv tvdunvdw. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Nonu ngam nyi adwnayak lokv chingching bv jwngkadakado; ngo yvvnyika jwngkadaka mapvnv. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Vbvritola ngo vbvrinam gubv rinv guilo, ngoogv jwngkadaka namv jvjvre, ogulvgavbolo so ngo akin mwngma; ngam vngmunv Abu ka ngam lvkobv reming gvdu. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Det 19:15</ref></char></note> So si nonugv Pvbv lo lvkpv vdwlo kayatayanv anyi gonv tolwk minsu bolo, bunu ogugo minpvdw hv jvjv ngv, <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Ngo atubogv lvgabv minsudo okv ngam vngmunv Abu ka ngoogv lvgabv mindvdo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Bunu tvvkato, “Ogolo no gv abu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Jisu mirwksito, “Nonu ngamla ngoogv Abu nyika chima, nonu ngam chinv guilo, ngoogv Abu nyika nonu chinre.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Jisu so mvnwngnga minto, Pwknvyarnvnaam lo karchung arwng lo morko lwkku jampa vvpvku hoka ninyigv tamsar sarnam aingbv. Okv yvvka ninyia naatung mato, ogulvgavbolo ninyigv dw ngv aatv madvto.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngo ogolo vngtv dudw nonu hoka vngnyu mare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Jisu lvkodv bunua minto, “Ngo vngro reku: nonu ngam kaakar reku, vbvritola nonu nonugv rimurlo silwk reku. Nonu vngnyu mare ngoogv vngkulo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Jius nyi kainv vdwv minto, “Hv mindu ninyigv vngjikolo ngonu vngnyu mare vla. Svbv minam si hv atubongv mvki sidubv mindu nvgo bri?”<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Nonu so lvkwng gv Sichingmooku so gvngv, vbvritola ngo ao tolokv inv ngv. Nonu so Sichingmooku so gvngv, vbvritola ngo so Sichingmooku gvngvma. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Vkvlvgabv ngo nonua minpa pvkunv nonuno silwkre nonugv rimurlo. Okv nonu sireku nonugv rimurlo vdwlo nonu ‘Ngo Yvvkudw Ngo’ um nonu mvngjwng maridw.”<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Bunu tvvkato, “No yvvla?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jisu mirwksito, “Atuk lokv ngo nonua ogugo minpvdw.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Atok alu lokv ngoogv nonua inta jikunamv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngo ogulvkwngbv nonua mvnwng nga japdubv?</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Ngo nonugv lvga nga minse ngv awgo doodu, awgo nonua mia sengv. Ngam vngmunv angv, ogubv rijeka jvjv ngv, okv ngo nyiamookua mintamdu ninyi gvlo tvvnam dvdv nga mwngchik.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Bunu Jisunyi ninyigv Abu gv lvga nga bunua mindunv vla tvchin mato. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Vkvlvgabv hv bunua minto, “Vdwlo nonu Nyia Kuunyilo nga tungcha rikudw, ho nonu chinre ‘Ngo Yvvkudw Ngo;’ vbvrikubolo nonu chireku ngo atunvgv chinampanam lokv oguguka rima, vbvritola ngo mindu Abu gv mintoka vla minam a ngo mimwngdunv. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Okv yvvdw ngam vngmunv hv ngam lvkobv redunv; hv ngam akinbv kayuma, ogulvgavbolo ngo lokia ninyigv mvnglwkbv ridunv.”<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Achialv nvgo Jisunyi so mvnwng sum mindubv tvvnv vdwv mvngjwng nyatoku.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jvjv ngv nonua ajarabi more</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu ninyia mvngjwngnv vdwa minto, “Nonu ngoogv tamsar nama tvvnvrinv gubv ribolo, nonu jvjvbv ngoogv lvbwlaksu v; <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>nonu jvjv nga chinreku okv jvjv ngv nonua ajarabi moriku.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mt 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Lk 3:8</ref></char></note>“Ngonu Abraham gv husi hv,” bunu mirwkto, “okv ngonu yvv gvka nyirabv rikw manv. Vbvrinamv noogv nonua ajarabi kunam gubv mvreku vla minammv oguv?”<verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Ngo jvjv nga nonua minjidunv: nyichar mvnwngngv yvvdw rimur dunv hv rimur gv nyirabv ridunv. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Nyira ngv vpinlo doobwng madunv, vbvritola kuunyilo ngv doobwng nvgobv ridunv. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Kuunyilo ngv nonua ringlin mooku bolo, vbvrikunamv nonu jvjvrungbv ajarabi kunamv. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Ngo chindu nonu Abraham gv husi hv. Vbvrirung gvrila nonu ngam mvki dubv rikwdo, ogulvgavbolo nonu ngoogv tamsar nama torwk simare. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Ngo, ngoogv abu ogugo kaatam pvdw ho lvgabv mindunv, vbvritola nonu ridu nonugv abu nonua ogugo minpv pvdw.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Bunu mirwkto, “Ngonugv abuv Abraham.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jisu mirwksito, “Nonu jvjvbv Abraham gv Kuu gubolo, nonuka hv ogugo ripvdw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:39</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nonuno jvjv gunv guilo nonu ripvnvpv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitap lo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nonu nvgobolo rire. </char></note> ho apiabv rire. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Ngoogv rinam mvnwngngv ngo ogugo Pwknvyarnv gvlokv tvvpvdw nonua jvjv nga minji dubv vla ripvnv, vjvka nonu ngam mvkidubv rikwdo. Abraham svkv aingbv rimato! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Nonu nonugv abu gv rinam apiabv ridungdo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">“Pwknvyarnv mvngchik ngonugv Abu doonv ngv,” bunu mirwkto, “okv ngonu ninyigv kuunyilo jvjv ngv.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Jvjvbv Pwknvyarnv nonugv Abu bv rinv guilo, nonu ngam ayare, ogulvgavbolo ngo Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aanv ngv okv vjak ngo si doodu. Ngo atubogv jwkrw lokv aasuma vbvritola hv nga vngmupvnv. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Ngo ogugo mindudw nonu ogubv chima dunv? So si ogulvgavbolo nonu ngoogv doin ha tvvya nwngmado. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Nonuno Uyudvbv gv kuu ngv, okv nonu abu gv mvngjimvngro kolo rinwngnv. Atuk lokv hv gwngrw gwnv okv vdwloka jvjvgv takbv aakw manv, ogulvgavbolo hoka ninyigvlo jvjv achuk guka dooma. Vdwlo nw mvridw, nw ninyigv riching bv ridunv, ogulvgavbolo nw mvkinv okv mvnv mvnwng gv abuv. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Vbvritola ngo jvjv nga minjidu, vkvlvgabv nonu ngam mwngjwng madunv. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nonu gvlokv akonv yvvla ngam rimur nvgobv vla gungnying lwkla gaknyu jinv? Ngo jvjv nga mindu bolo, vbvrikunamv nonu ogubv ngam tvvjing madunv? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Yvvdw Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aadunv Pwknvyarnv gv gamchar vdwa tvvdunv. Nonu, ogubvrijeka, Pwknvyarnv lokvma, okv vkvlvgabv nonuno tvya madunv.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Bunu Jisunyi tvvkato, “Ngonugv nam samaritan go okv no uyuvram gvnvgo vla minam v minjwk mapvnvre?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngoogvlo uyuvram dooma, ngo Abunyi mvngdv dunv okv nonu ngam miakaya dunv. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Ngo atubogv lvgabv mvngdvnam makar madunv. Vbvritola hoka um makarnv ako doodu okv hv ngogvbv jwngkadakayadu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Ngo jvjv nga nonua minjidunv: yvvdw ngoogv tamsar nama tvvdunv hv vdwloka simare.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Bunu ninyia minto, “Vjak ngonu jvjvbv mvngduku no gvlo uyuvram doorungdo! Abraham siroku, okv nyijwk vdwvka siroku, vjvka no mindu yvvdw no gv tamsar nama tvvrinv hv vdwloka simare vla. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Ngonugv abu Abraham siroku; no Abrahamnyi kaiyanv gubv mvngsu dunvre? Okv nyijwk vdwvka siroku. No atuv yvv vla mvngsudunv?”<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>“Ngo atuv mvngdv subolo, ho mvngdv namv ogu arv doomare. Ngam mvngdvnv angv ngoogv Abu—nonugv Pwknvyarnv vla minam angv. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Nonu vdwloka ninyia chimato, vbvritola ngo ninyia chindu. Ngo ninyia chima vla minbolo, ngo nonugv apiabv mvvki nvgobv ripvnvpv. Vbvritola ngo ninyia chirung dunv, okv ninyigv gamchar a tvvdunv. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Nonugv abu Abraham ngoogv aaji nama kaanwngla mvngpula kaacho toku okv himpu toku.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Bunu ninyia minto, “No vjak anying chamngu goka svngtv madv—okv no Abrahamnyi kaapv nvlv?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:57 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">No Abraahmnyi katoku?; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mego kitaplo lvknamgo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abraham nam kapvkunvi?</char></note>”<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Jisu mirwksito, “Ngo jvjv nga nonua minjidunv, Abrahamnyi bvngtv madvbv, ‘Ngoonv.’”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu ninyia vlwng ordubv vla naarap toku, vbvritola Jisu atubongv tosisito okv Pwknvyarnvnaam a vngyu toku.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu nyi ako bvnglin lokv nyikching nvgo mvpu toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Jisu vbv vngkarminto, nw nyi ako bvnglin lokv nyikching nvgo kaapa toku. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia tvvkato, “Tamsarnv, yvvgv rimur vkudw ninyia bvngrilokv nyikching monv? Hv atugv lokvre vmalo ninyigv anvabu gv rimur lokvre?”<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Si so nyi gv rimur vmalo ninyigv anvabu gv rimur lokv ninyia nyikching moma. So nyi si nyikching pvnv v, ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv gv jwkrw okv rinam a ninyi gvlokv kaatam dubv. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Vdwgo aluv asubv doodv ridw, ngonu ngam vngmunvgv lvgabv kudungkua riji rungdubv ridu; kanv ngv aariku vdwlo yvvka kudungkua rinyu kumare. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mt 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Jn 8:12</ref> </char></note>Ngo vdwgo nyiamooku so dooridw, ngo nyiamooku gv loung ngv.”<verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Vbv so miro kochingbv, Jisu kvdw lo tachor chorbiakto okv chorbiak kolokv eriungbv mego mvto; nw nyi hvkvgv nyiklo piaklwkto <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>okv minto, “Vngnyika okv noogv nyukmua sokak teka siloam gv svlv lo,” (Siloam vla minam si “vngmukunam”). Vkvlvgabv nyi angv vngtoku, ninyigv nyokmua sokak toku, okv nyiktarla kaying lakula aakur toku.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Vbvrikunamv, ninyigv namrwk ajin vdwv okv ninyia kvvlo dvku koodubv kaanv vdwv, tvvka minsunyato, “So nyi si mabvre dootung tvla kookinv angv?”<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Megonv minto, “Hv mabv,” vbvritola kvvbi vdwv minto, “Ma hv ma; hv ho nyi anga gvvnv go.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Vkvlvgabv nyi angv atuv minto, “Nyi angv ngo mabv.”<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Bunu ninyia tvvkato, “No vjak oguaingbv rila kaapa nyudukunv?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Hv mirwksito, “Jisu vnam nyi angv kvdw mego naala eriungbv mego mvto, um ngoogv nyiklo piaklwkto, okv ngam Siloam lo vngla nyukmua soktoka vla minto. Vkvlvgabv ngo vngtoku, okv vdwlo ngo sokdanam gola ngo kaapa nyutoku,”<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Bunu tvvkato, “Hv ogolo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Nyi angv mirwksito, “Ngo chingkuma.”<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Parisis vdwv mvpu nama tvvcharkayar toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Vbvrikunamv bunu nyikchingnv nyi anga Parisis vdwgvlo aagv jitoku. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Jisu gv kvdw a eriungbv mvla okv ninyigv nyikching nama mvpu kunam alu v Jius Doonualulo rito. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Vbvrikunamv, Parisis vdwv, nyi anga oguaingbv rila hv kaapa pvku nvdw vla tvvkato. Hv bunua mintam toku, “Nw kvdw eriung vkv ngoogv nyik so piaklwkto; ngo nyukmua sokak toku okv ngo vjak kaapa nyudukunv.”<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Parisis megonv minto, “Sum rinv nyi angv si Pwknvyarnv gvlokvma, ogulvgavbolo (nw jius Doonualu gv pvbv gvbv rijima.”)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Kvvbi vdwv, ogubvrijeka, minyato, “Oguaingbv nyi rimur nvngv svkvnv lamrwpanam a svbv kaatam nyuladubv?” Okv hoka bunugv apumlo akuaku subv mvngnya rinyato.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Vkvlvgabv Parisis vdwv nyi anga lvkodv tvvdito, “No mindu hv noogv nyikching nama mvpupv vla—alvdo, no ninyia oguv vla mindunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Nyi angv mirwksito, “Hv Nyijwk go.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Jius nyi kainv vdwv, ogubvrijeka, mvngjwng mato hv nyikching dvbv bvngnam go okv vjak kaapa nyudukunv vla, rinyung nga bunu ninyigv anvabua goklwkto <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>okv bunua tvvkato, “Si nonugv kuunyilo ngvre? Nonu mindu ninyia nyikching dubv bvngpvnv; vbvrikunamv, oguaingbv hv vjak kaapa nyudukunv?”<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>Ninyigv anvabuv mirwksito, “Ngonu chindu hv ngonugv kuunyilo ngv, okv ngo chindu ninyia nyikching dubv bvngpvnv. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Vbvritola ngonu chima hv oguaingbv vjak kaapa nyudu kunvbvri, ngonu vbvka chima yvvdw ninyigv nyikching nga mvpu pvnv. Ninyia tvvka toka; hv kaipvku, okv atuv mirwk sinyu reku!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Ninyigv anvabuv svbv minto, ogulvgavbolo bunu Jius nyi kainv vdwa busuto, vbv tolwk minsuto yvvdw Jisunyi Kristo vla mvngjwng dvnvkv vnv anga Jius kumkunaam lokv naala naa reku. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Vkvlvgabv ninyigv anvabuv vbv minto, “Hv kaipvku; ninyia tvvka laka!”<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Lvnyi nanvbv bunu nyi nyikching dubv bvngnam anga gokorto okv ninyia minto, “Pwknvyarnv gvlo milvla minto no jvjv nga milin jire vla! Ngonu chindu nam mvpunv nyi angv rimur nvgo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Nyi angv mirwksito, “Ngo chima hv rimur nvgobvre vmalo rimur manv gobvre, ngo ako chinsudo: ngo nyikchingto, okv vjak ngo kaapa duku.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>“Hv ogugo nam rikunamv?” bunu tvvkato. “Hv oguaingbv nam nyikching nga mvpu kunamv?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>“Ngo nonua mintam ropvkunv,” hv mirwkto, “okv nonu tvya magvrila. Nonu ogubv lvkodv tvvnwng dunv? Lvkonyika nonu ninyigv lvbwlaksu bv rinwng pvnv gubvre?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Bunu ninyia beela okv minto, “No vlo nyi gv lvbwlaksu gumabv; vbvritola ngonu Moses gv lvbwlaksu vdwv. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Ngonu chindu Pwknvyarnv Mosesnyi raarwksuto; ogubvrijeka, vlo nyi anga, ngonu chima hv ogolokv aapvnvdw!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Nyi angv mirwkto, “Hv tvvkwkaakw manam gulaka! nonu chima hv ogolokv aapvnvdw, vbvritola hv nga ngoogv nyikching nama mvpu jipvku! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Ngonu chindu Pwknvyarnv vdwloka rimurnv nyi ha tvvma dunv; hv tvvdu nyi yvvdw ninyia mvngdv dunv okv ninyigv minam ha rinv vdwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Sichingmookua pwklinyarlin rilokv naala Vjakgobv yvvka tvvpama nyi nga bvnglin lokv nyikching nvnga kaapa dukubv mvnv. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>So nyi si Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aama nvgoilo hv vdwloka vkvnv aba go rinyu mare.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Bunu mirwkto, “Nam rimurlo bvnglinla okv sotv pvkunv—okv no ngonua tamsar dubv rikwdoi?” Okv bunu ninyia Jius kumkunaam loka naalin toku.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yalu lo Nyikchingnv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Ogugo ripvkudw um vdwlo Jisu tvvpa tokudw, hv nyi anga kaapa toku okv ninyi tvkato, “No Nyia Kuunyilo nga mvngjwng dunvre?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Nyi angv mirwkto, “Tamsarnv, hv yvvdw nga minpalabv ngo ninyia mvngjwng nyula dukubv!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “No ninyia kaaropvkunv, okv ho nyi angv vjak nam lvkobv gaam raadung minsudo.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Nyi angv minto, “Ahtu, ngo mvngjwng dukunv!” okv hv Jisu gv haabolo guplwk toku.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Jisu minto, “Ngo nyiamooku so jwngkadaka tebv aapvnv, nyikching nvngv kaaparungdu kubv okv yvvdw kaapa dunv nyikching rungdu kubv.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Parisis nyi mego hoka ninyia lvkobv rinv, ninyia vbv mindubv tvvgvrila okv ninyia tvvkato, “Jvjvbv no ngonua ka nyikching nvngv vla minta madunvre?”<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Jisu mirwkto, “vbvrikunamv nonu nyikching nvgoilo, nonu rigakpanam dootvma; vbvritola nonu kaapadunv vla mimbwngla minro pvku, vbv minam si kunv nonu vjakgobv rigakpanam doodukunv.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Svlar kaaya nvlo minchisinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Jisu minto, “Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: Yvvnyi ngv svlarnaam lo agi lokv aamadunv, vbvritola kvvbi lamtv lokv gvkarnv hv dvchonv okv dvritnaaritnv. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Yvvnyi ngv agi lokv aadunv hv svlar vdwa kaayanvngv. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Agi kaayanvngv agi a ninyigv lvgabv mvkok jire; svlar vdwv ninyigv vlv nga tvvpare hv ninyigv svlar a amina minla gokrikunyi, okv hv bunua agumbv linggv reku. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>Vdwlo hv bunua agum lo linggv rilo, hv bunua vngchola vnggvdu, okv svlar vdwv ninyia vngming gvdu, ogulvgavbolo bunu ninyigv vlv nga tvvchin do. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Bunu kvvbia vngming gvmare; vmabvya bunu kiyu yare vkvnv nyi nga ogulvgavbolo bunu ninyigv vlv nga tvvchinma.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Jisu bunua so minchisinam sum minjito, vbvritola bunuv ogugonyi mindunvdw um tvchin mato.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu alvbv Svlar Kaaya nvngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu lvkodv mindvto, “Ngo jvjv nga nonua minji dunvla: Ngo svlar gv agi ngv. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Kvvbi mvnwngngv yvvdw ngam aachoyadunv hv dvchonv okv dvritnaaritnv, vbvritola svlar hv bunua tvvma duku. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Ngo agi v yvvdw ngo gvlokv arwng aadunv hv ringnam ha paare; hv arwnglo aare okv agumbv vngre okv nvmwng mapareku. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Dvchonv arwng aadu ogulvgavbolo dvcho dubv, mvkidubv, okv mvyakmvchak dubv. Ngo aapvnv nonua svngsu alvbv singmu rimu dubv.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Ngo alvnv svlar kaayanv, yvvdw svlar lvgabv sidubv mvngnv ngv, <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Svlar sokw manv okv kaaya riakw manv jonam nyi ngv vdwlo svcha nga aadu bv kaaparinyi, hv svlar a kayupila okv kiudunv; vkvlvgabv svcha ngv gamdu okv bunua charjung charngola charra dukunv. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Jonam nyi ngv kiudunv ogulvgavbolo hv jonam nyi vmwng okv svlar a alvbv kaaria madunv. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mt 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Lk 10:22</ref></char></note> Ngo alvnv svlar kaayanv. Abu ngam chindu okv ngo Abunyi chindu, vkv aingbv ngo ngoogv svlar ha chindu okv bunu ngam chindu. Okv ngo bunugv lvgabv sidubv mvngdunv. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Ngoogv svlar kvgonv so svlarnaam soka doomanv vka doodunv. Ngo bunuaka so naalwk rungre, bunu ngoogv vlv nga tvvre, okv bunu svlar vdwa akin <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bunu vbvire; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ho hokaka.</char></note>gubvrila kaayanv akingv kaanam gubv rireku.”<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Abu ngam pakdunv ogulvgavbolo ngo ngoogv singnam a mvngnga sidubv mvngdunv, vkvlvga um ngo paakor nyula dukubv vla. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Yvvka ngoogv singnam ha ngoogv lokv dvrit mare. Ngo um ngo atubongv anyubv mvngnga supvnv, ngo um jilaka nyure okv ngo um naakurka nyula reku. So sumnv ngoogv Abu nga ritokv vla gamki la minam v.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Lvkodv nyi vdwv apumlo so gaam vdw so gv lvgabv asak sutoku. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Bunugv lokv nyi achialvgo minyato, “Hv uyuvram gvdu! Hv surupv! nonu ninyia ogulvgabv tvvya dunv?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Vbvritola kvvbi vdwv minyato, “Nyi uyuvram gvnv ngv svbv minyu madunv! oguaingbv uyuvram v nyikchingnv nyi vdwa nyiktarla kaapa dukubv mvla nyudubv?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi toa toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>So si svkar poolu bv ritoku, okv Pwknvyarnvnaam a kumkok jokok lwkdw pumja nga Jerusalem lo ritoku. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Jisu Pwknvyarnvnaam gv Solomon Pvrvlo vngkarto, <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>vdwlo nyi vdwv ninyia goyum tokudw okv tvvkato, “No ngonua vdwnvgo ayungbv angaaja mobwng modubv? Jvjv nga ngonua minjilabv: no Kristo rungre?”<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Ngo nonua mintam jipvkunv, vbvritola nonu nga mvngjwng mato. Ngo, ngo Abu gv ngo lvgabv tolwkkunam ha minku lokv ngo hvkvnv ogu vdwa ridu; <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>vbvritola nonu mvngjwng mare, vkvlvgabv nonu ngoogv svlar ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ngoogv svlar v ngoogv minam ha tvvya dunv; ngo bunua chindu, okv bunu ngam vngming gvdu. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>Ngo bunua turbwngnv singnam ha jidunv, okv bunu vdwloka sikumare. Yvvka bunua ngoogv loka dvrit nyulamare. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hogugo ngogv abu nga jipkudw kairongnv; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngogv abu bunua yvvdw jinvngv nga si kaiyanv.</char></note> Ngo Abu gv ngam jinammv ogumvnwng nga kaiyanvngv, Abu gv ringchum kunam lokv yvvka bunua dvrit nyulamare. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Abu la ngo akinnv.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Vbvrikunamv nyi vdwv ninyia ordubv vla vlwng naarap nyatoku. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Abu gv ngam ritokv vla jinam a ngo alvnv achialvgo nonugv kaakulo ritoku; so gv alvnv rinam sokv ogubv nonu nga vlwng ortv dunv?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Leb 24:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bunu mirwksito, “Ngonu nam alvnv rinam lvkwngbv vlwng ortvma, vbvritola no gv Pwknvyarnvnyi minyingminchu kunam lvkwnglo! No nyi nyimummv mvngchik, vbvritola no atuv Pwknvyarnv gubv mvsudubv rikwngdu!”<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 82:6">Miri 82:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu mirwkto, “So si nonugv Pvbv lo lvkpvpv Pwknvyarnv minto, ‘Nonu Pwknvyarnv vdwv.’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Ngonu chindu Darwknv Kitaplo ogugo lvkpvdw hv jvjv bwngre; okv Pwknvyarnv ho nyi vdwa Pwknvyarnv vdwv vla minto, ninyigv doin a jikunam nyi vdwa. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Ngogvbv Abu ngam darto okv nyiamooku lo imuto. Vbvrikunamv, ngo Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv vnam lvkwnglo nonu ngam oguaingbv Pwknvyarnvnyi minyingminchudu vla minyu dunv? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Vbvrikunamv ngam mvngjwng mabvka, ngo ngo Abu gv ngam ritokv vnam ha rima dunvlo. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Vbvritola ngo bunua rijeka, nonu ngam mvngjwngma, nonu ngoogv rinam lokaka achukgo mvngjwng tvvka, Abu ngoogvlo doodu okv ngo Abu gvlo doodu vla nonu mvnwngngv chiminam lvgabv.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Bunu lvkodv Jisunyi naatung dubv rikwto, vbvritola hv bunugv laak lokv doksok lintoku.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 1:28">Jn 1:28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Vbvrikunamv Jisu lvkodv vngkorla Jordan svko nga rapbola Jon gv baptisma jikulo vngtoku, okv hv hoka doolwk toku. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Nyi vdwv nw gvlo achialvgo aatoku. “Jon lamrwpanam rila kaatam ma,” bunu minto, “Vbvritola ninyigv so nyi gv lvgabv minam mvnwngngv Jvjv rungpv.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Okv hoka nyi achialvgo ninyia mvngjwng toku.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lajaras gv sinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Lk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref> </char>
    </note> Nyi ako aminv Lajaras vnamgo, nw Betani lo doonvgo lvvma toku. Betani vnamsi bangguv hoka Meri okv ninyigv bormv Marta dooto. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Jn 12:3</ref></char></note> So gv Meri angv si Jisunyi nampunv tvli lvpa lo piaknv okv um ninyigv dumpo dwmw lokv tipwnv angv; lvvmanv angv Lajaras ninyigv boru bv rito. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Anyibormv nyingv Jisunyi gaamgo milwk toku, “Ahtu, no gv ayanam ajin hv lvvma pvkv.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Vdwlo Jisu um tvvpa tokudw, nw minto, “So gv lvvma angv gv anyung ngv Lajarasnyi sinam gubv rimare; so rinam si Pwknvyarnvnyi kaimonam lvgabv, okv so si vbvrinam hv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngvka hartvnam paare.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Jisu Marta nyila ninyigv anyinyi okv Lajarasnyi paktoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Vbvrijvka vdwlo hv Lajaras lvvmapvkv vnam yunying nga tvvtolaka ninyigv dooku hoka hv alu lonyi godv doodv toku. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Vbvrikunamv nw ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minto, “Klai ngonu Judia bv vngkur lakuju.”<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>“Tamsarnv,” lvbwlaksu vdwv mirwkto, “Vjak mego ayungjvma nga nyi vdwv nam hoka vlwng ngv ordubv mvngnyato; no vngkur dukubv vla mvngdui?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Jisu minto, “Aluv gunta vring gola anyigo doodu, dooma dunvre? Vkvlvgabv yvvdw alu pua lo vngkar dunv hv pokmap madunv, hv nyiamooku gv lounglo kaapa kunam lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Vbvritola hv ayu rinyi vngkar bolo hv pokmapdo, ogulvgavbolo hv loung dooma.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Jisu sum minto, okv vbvrikunamv mindvto, “Ngonu ajin Lajaras yupvku, vbvritola ngo vngla okv ninyi muu riku.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Lwbwlaksu vdwv mirwkto, “Ahtu, nw yupdung dvnvlo hv alvriku.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Jisu gv minam v manv Lajaras sipvku vla, vbvritola bunu hv yupching bv yuppv nvgo vla mvngto. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu bunua jvjvbv mintam jitoku, “Lajaras siroku, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>vbvritola nonugv lvgabv ngo mvngpudo ngo ninyia lvkobv dooma toku, vkvlvga nonu ho mvngjwng dukubv. Klvi hv gvlo vnglaju.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Tomas (Bvngpiam vla minam) ninyigv ajin vdwa minto, “Klvi ngonu mvnwngngv Tamsarbonyi lvkobv vngming gvlaju, ngonuka ninyia lvkobv sikulo simi gvnam lvgabv!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu turkurkunam okv turnam v</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Vdwlo Jisu vngchi tokudw, Lajarasnyi nyibung riku namv alu loopi dukubv hv paatoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Betani ngv Jerusalem lokv lvtw aom gubv rito, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>okv Judia gv nyi achialvgo Meri okv Marta bunyigv boru sikunam lvgalo mvngdwk mabvkv vla mimbv okv kaalwkbv aanyatoku.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Jisu aariku vla vdwlo Marta tvvpa tokudw, nw kaarwk sidubv vnglintoku, vbvritola Meri naam lo dootoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marta Jisunyi mintoku, “Ahtu, no so doonv guilo ngoogv boruv sima dvnvpv! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Vbvritola ngo chindu vjakka no ninyia ogugo koodudw Pwknvyarnv nam jire.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Jisu ninyia mintam toku, “No gv boruv turkur reku.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marta mirwksito, “Ngo chindu, hv ataranya alulo turkur reku.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Turkurkunam vla singnam v ngo. Yvvdw nga mvngjwng dunv hv turre, hv sikujeka; <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>okv yvvdw singdunv okv ngam mvngjwng dunv hv vdwloka simare. No sum mvngjwng dunvre?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Hv mirwkto, “Vkv, Ahtu! ngo mvngjwng dunv no Kristo, Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo, yvvdw nyiamooku so aajikunv ngv.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu kaptoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Marta sum minro kochingbv nw vngkur toku, okv ninyigv anyi Merinyi minsila minjito. “Tamsarbo si doodu,” hv anyia minjitoku, “okv nam tvvkadu.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Vdwlo Meri sum tvvpa tokudw, hv gudung toku okv ninyia kaarwk sudubv baapubv vnglintoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Jisu vjaklodvbv nampumlo aachi madvto, vbvritola Marta gv ninyia kaarwk suku mookulo doobwngto. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Nyi vdwv naam lo Merinyi lvkobv doonv vdwv ninyia mvngdwk mabvkv vnyato, ninyia vngming gvnyato, vdwlo bunu ninyia baapubv gudungdanv agumbv vnglin nama kaato kudw, bunu ninyia nyibung lo kapdubv vngji nvgo vla mvngnyato.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Jisu ogolo doopvdw hoka Meri vngchi toku, okv hv baapubv ninyia kaapa danam gula, hv Jisu gv lvpa lo gipv toku. “Ahtu,” hv minto, “No so doonv guilo, ngoogv boruv sima dvnvpv!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Jisu ninyia kapdubv kaatoku, okv ninyia lvkobv rinv vdwvka oguaingbv kapdudw umka kaatoku; vbvrinam hv ninyigv haapok ka mvsit la, okv achialvbv mvngdwk motoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>Hv bunua tvvkato, “Nonu ninyia ogolo nyibung riipvnv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Bunu mirwkto, “Ahtu, Aala okv kaatoka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Jisu kapto. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Nyi vdwv minto, “Kaatoka, ninyia achialvbv pakdu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Vbvritola bunu megonv minto, “Hv nyikching nvnga kaapa dukubv mvtoku, nw mvmma pvnvre? Nw Lajarasnyi sima dubv mvnyu mapv nvdw?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lajarasnyi turkur motoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Lvkodv mvngdwk hilok laikula dooku mabvku, Jisu nyibung lo vngtoku hv lvngpwk bv rito agi aagia nga vlwng ajap nvgo jootum kunam go. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Jisu minto, “Vlwng nga dvato!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Marta, sinv nyi angv gv anyiv, mirwkto, “Ahtu, hoka naya amokrikv. Ninyia nyibung riikunamv alu loopi roku!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Ngo nam mimapvnvre, no mvngjwng bolo Pwknvyarnv gv jwkrw nga kaapare vla?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Bunu vlwng nga dva toku. Jisu aobv kaadungto okv minto, “Abu, ngo nam umbonyikv, no nga tvvyadu. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ngo chindu no lokia ngam tvvyadu, vbvritola ngo sung mindu so nyi vdw so gv lvgabv, ogulvgavbolo so nyi vdw si no ngam vngmupvnv vla mvngjwng dukubv.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Hv vbv minro kochingbv, hv gamtv rungbv gokto, “Lajaras, lintokuka!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Hv nyibung lokv lintoku, ninyigv lvpa laak ha vji puching dvdubv, okv nyukmu haka puching dvdubv. Jisu bunua minto, “Ninyia paksok la, okv vngmu tokuka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyirunv vdwv Jisunyi rinying toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mt 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mk 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Lk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Nyi achialvgo Merinyi kaalwkla aanv vdwv Jisu ogugo ripvkudw kaanya toku okv bunu ninyia mvngjwng nyatoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Vbvritola megonv bunu Parisis vdwgvlo vngkur toku okv Jisu ogugo ripvkudw minpa toku. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Vkvlvgabv Parisis vdwv, okv nyibu butvnv vdwv Kvba vdwa lvkobv kaarwksuto okv minto, “Ngonu oguridukubv? Kaatokuka so nyi gv lamrwpanam kaatamnam ma! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Ngonu so nyi sum svbv ribwng mobolo, nyichar mvnwngngv ninyia mvngjwng riku, okv Roman nyi kainv vdwv tvvchar kayarre okv ngonugv Pwknvyarnvnaam ha mvyakmvchak riku okv ngonugv haalung ngakka!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Bunugv lokv akonv, aminv Kayapas, yvvdw ho anying hoka Nyibu Butvyachok nvbv rinv angv, minto, “Nonu ogu pvcha pvnvri! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Nonu mvngdi malare, haalung gv yaktv svnga, nonugv lvgabv alvyanvngv, nyi akin gonv nyi vdwgv lvgabv siria monam si?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Minjvjvbolo hv sung atuv mvngsula mimato; vmabvya hv ho anying gv Nyibu Butvyachok nvbv rinam lvgabv, hv nyikrw kaala Jisu Jius nyi vdwgv lvgabv siria tvdu vla, <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>okv bunua mvngchikma, vbvritola Pwknvyarnvnyi mooku mvnwnglo doosik kunv vdwa akin gubvku naadumsidu kubvka.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Ho alu lokv Jius nyi kainv vdwv Jisunyi mvkidubv rungtoku. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu Judia mookulo nyi kaagialo vngkar matoku, vbvritola vngyu toku okv chukrimooku nvchi mooku gulo vngtoku, Epraim vnam banggu gulo hoka ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv doolwk toku.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Vngbokunam Pumja dvdw ngv nvchi toku, nyi achialv go mooku lokv pumja rima dwbv ridar kakdar koodubv vla Jerusalem lo aanya toku. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Bunu Jisunyi kaakarnyato, okv bunu Pwknvyarnvnaam lo vngkum nyatoku, bunu akonv ako nvnga tvvka minsuto, “No ogubv mvngdu? Hv pumja so aarung mare, ma aaridw?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Nyibu butvnv vdwv okv Parisis vdwv orto jipvpv yvvdw Jisu ogolo doopvdw um chinv ngv, hv minpa laka, vkvlvgavbolo bunu ninyia naatung nyudukubv.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Betani lo tvli piaktoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mt 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Vngbokunam pumja ridwv alu lookv go doodubv, Jisu Betani bv vngtoku, ninyigv siku nvnga turkur mokunam Lajaras gv naam lo. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Bunu ninyigv lvgabv arium dvse go hoka mvpv jito, Marta ridurto ordubv; Lajarasnyi akonv yvvdw Jisunyi lvkobv tvbul lo dootung minggvnv. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Lk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note>Vbvrikunamv Meri maatarbv arv doonv nampunv Nard<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nard vnam si achialvbv arv doonv nvnv singnv</char></note> tvli vkv pumchup go naatoku, um Jisu gv lvpalo pwke toku, okv um ninyigv dwmw lokv tipw toku. Ho gv tvli gv nampunv amok hv naam arwng mvnwnglo jukar toku. <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Jisu gv lvbwlaksu vdwlokv akonv Judas Iskeriot—yvvdw ninyia koa kujinv angv—minto, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Ogubv so nampunv tvli sum ain lokdwng lvngngom gubv piokma pvnv <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Raji lokdwng: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaatoka 6.7.</char></note>okv morko nga heemanv vdwlo jima pvnv?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Ninyigv sum minam si hv heemanv vdwa kaala tvla rigvdu vnamgo kaama, vbvritola hv dvcho nvgobv riato. Hv morko gvgianvnv nga gvla rigvto okv atubongv dvsidvpit suto.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Vbvritola Jisu minto, “Ninyia akinbv risu moto! ninyia ogugo doogv pvkudw vvpvmoto nga nyibung ritvri alu gv lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Det 15:11</ref></char></note>No alu gv lokia heema nvnga lvkobv ribam tvdu, vbvritola no ngam lokia ribam paaku mare.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lajarasnyi mvkidubv gwngnam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Nyitwng tvngtv go Jisu Betani lo doopvku vla tvvpa toku, vkvlvgabv bunu hoka vngtoku, Jisu dopvkv vnam mwngchik lokvma vbvritola Jisu gv nyi siku nvnga turkur mokunam, Lajaras nyika kaadu bvka. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Vkvlvgabv Nyibu butvnv vdwv Lajaras nyika mvki tadubv rungtoku, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>ogulvgavbolo ninyigv lvgalo Jius nyi achialvgo bunua toa toku okv Jisunyi mvngjwng nyatoku.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jerusalem lo Dvbv bv aatoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mt 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Lk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Alu logo nvnga kainv nyipam v Vngbokunam Pumja lo aanv vdwv Jisu Jerusalem lo aarikv vla tvvpa toku. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Miri 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note>Vkvlvgabv bunu taru ruda rumwng doodubv naatoku okv ninyia kaarwk sidubv vnglinla, goknyato, “Pwknvyarnvnyi hartvto! Ahtu gv amin bv aanv nga Pwknvyarnv ninyia boktalwkji laka! Pwknvyarnv boktalwkji laka Israel gv Dvbvnyi!”<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Jisu siak go paatoku okv vkvgv aolo gecha toku, Darwknv Kitaplo minam ching-ching bv,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Jek 9:9</ref></char></note>Jayon pamtv gv nyi vdwa, busu mabvka!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Siinv aarikunv nonugv dvbv ngv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">Joklwk rikunv siak yakpa aolo dootokula.”<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Ho dw hoka ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv sung chima toku; vbvritola vdwlo Jisu turkurla yunglit gubv ritokudw, bunu mvngpa toku Darwknv Kitaplo ninyigv lvga nga sum minpvku okv bunu ritoku sum ninyigv lvgabv.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Jisu gv rikulo lvkobv rinv nyi vdwv vdwlo nw Lajarasnyi nyibung loka goklin kunam ha okv siku nvnga turkur mooku nama kaanv vdwv minpa nyatoku ogugo ripvkudw. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Vbvrikunam lvgabv nyipam v ninyi kaarwk sutoku-ogulvgavbolo bunu tvvpa toku hv so lamrwpanam sum rila kaatampv vla. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Vbvrikunamv Parisis vdwv akonv ako nvnga mimi sutoku, “No kaatoka, ngo oguka ria yala kuma! Kaakwto, nyiamooku nyi mvnwngngv ninyia reming gvdu kunv!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Grik nyi mego Jisunyi makarto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Grik nyi mego Pumja lo kumdujodubv Jerusalem lo aanv nyi vdwgv apumlo vngming gvtato. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Bunu Pilip gvlo vngtoku (hv Galili gv Betsaida lokv ngv) okv minto, “Tamsarnv, ngonu Jisunyi kaanwngdo.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Pilip vngtoku okv Andriunyi mintamto, okv bunyi anyiv vngtoku okv Jisunyi minpa toku. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Nyia Kuunyilo gv kairungbv hartv paadwv aaduku. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: aam amchar hv kvdwbolo chilwkla simumabolo amchar hv charkin tvla doobwngre, vbvrikunamv um chilwkla simukubolo, hv hintar go amring ngv ringtvyare. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mt 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Lk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note> Yvvdw atugv singnam ha paksu dunv hv ung nyemuyare; yvvdw atubogv singnam ha nyiamooku so kaanwng madunv hv torbwngnama paayare. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Yvvdw nga mvdur ridur nvpv mvngdunv hv nga vngming gvvrung laka, vbvrikubolo ngoogv pakbuv ngo ogolo doopvdw lvkobv dooming gvreku. Okv ngoogv Abu nga mvdur ridur nvnga mvngdv re.”<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv sise lvkwng nga mintoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Vjak ngoogv haapok v adwkaku do—okv ngo ogugo mvku svngvdw? Ngo vbv minre, ‘Abu, so gv dw sum ngoogvlo aamu mabv?’ Vbvritola ngo ho lvgabv aapvnv-so gv hirukaya sung ngo hirung svngvrung. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Abu no gv aminha kai moya toka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Vbvrikunamv nyido mooku tolokv vlv go duluto, “Ngo um yungnam gubv naalwk pvkunv, okv ngo lvkodv vbv ritare.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Hoka nyipam daknv vdwv vlv nga tvvpato, megonv bunu minto, hv doogum go, kvgonv minto, “Nyido gindung gunv ninyia raami supv!”<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Vbvritola Jisu bunua minto, “Ho gv vlv dunam v ngoogv lvgabvma, vbvritola nonugv lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Vjakgv alu si nyiamooku a jwngkadakaku alu vku; vjak nyiamooku gv dvbv nga chara reku. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Vdwlo ngam nyiamooku sokv naacha rekudw, ngo nyichar mvnwngnga ngoogvlo naalwk sureku.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>Svbv minam si ninyigv hirukayala sise nga minto.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Miri 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Aij 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Eje 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char>
    </note>Nyipam v mirwkto, “Ngonugv Pvbv lo mindu Kristo turla doobwngre. Vbvrikunamv, ogubv, no mindunv nyia Kuunyilo nga naacha riku vla? Nyia kuunyilo vnam si yvvla?”<verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Loung ngv achukgo nonu gvlo dooming gvmwngre. Loung gv ungla doorilo nonugv lamtvlo vnglvlaka, ogulvgavbolo nonu gvlo kanv ngv putum manam lvgabv; yvvdw kanv lo vngkar dunv chinsuma hv ogolo vngdung dunvdw. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Vbvrikunamv, vdwgo loung ngv nonu gvlo doodudw, loung nga mvngjwng laka, vkvlvga nonu loung gv nyi bv ridubv.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Nyi vdwgv mvngjwng manam</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jisu sum minro kochingbv, vngyu toku okv bunugv lokv tosi sutoku. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Hv vdwnvgo bunugv kaakulo so lamrwpanam mvnwngnga rila kaatam kujeka, bunu ninyia mvngjwng matoku, <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Aij 53:1</ref> </char></note>vkvlvga nyijwk Aijaya ogugo minpvdw v jvjvbv aarungre:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:38">“Ahtu, ngonugv doin minkunama yvvla mvngjwng jinv?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Yvvnyila Ahtu gv jwkrw a kaatam tvvdunv?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Okv vkvlvgabv bunu mvngjwng nyula kuma, ogulvgavbolo Aijaya mindvto,<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:10">Aij 6:10</ref> </char>
    </note>“Pwknvyarnv bunugv nyik vdwa kaapa moma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">okv bunugv mongrumara nga mvtumro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">vkvlvga bunugv nyikkv kaapa madu kubv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">okv bunugv mongrumara ngv chima dubv,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">okv bunu nga dakrwk madubv, Pwknvyarnv minto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ngo amin bv bunua mvpu dubv.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Aijaya sum mintoku ogulvgavbolo hv Jisu gv kai kuse nga kaapa chotokula okv ninyigv lvkwngbv minto.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Vbvrikujeka, Jius nyi kainv achialvgo Jisunyi mvngjwng nyatoku; vbvritola Parisis vdwgv lvgalo bunu um minkokla milin nyumato, Jius kumkunaam lokv naalin konwng manam lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Bunu Pwknvyarnv gv naarwk sunamma mvngbiu mabv nyi gv naarwk sunamma mvngbiu yato.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv Gamchar vdwlokv jwngkadakanam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Jisu gamtv rungbv minto, “Yvvbunudw ngam mvngjwng dunv hv ngam mvngchikma vbvritola yvvdw ngam vngmupvnv nw nyika. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Yvvdw ngam kaadunv hv ngam vngmunv humka kaadunv. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Ngo nyiamooku so loung gubvrila aapvnv, vkvlvga yvvdw ngam mvngjwngnv nyichar mvnwngngv kanv arwnglo doobwng manam lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Yvv akonv ngoogv doin ha tvvdunv okv um rima dunv, ngo ninyia jwngkadaka mare. Ngo nyiamookua jwngkadaka dubv aamapvnv, vbvritola um ringdubaadu bv aapvnv. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Yvvdw nga toa dunv okv ngoogv doin ha naarwk suma dunv um ninyia jwngkadaka reku. Ngoogv gaam japnam vdwv ataranya alulo ninyi jwngkadaka rireku! <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>So si jvjv ngv, ogulvgavbolo ngo atugv mvngnam lokv mimato, vbvritola ngoogv Abu ngam vngmunv hv ngo ogugo minse ngvdw okv japse ngvdw gamki nama um ngo mindunv. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Okv ngo chindu ninyigv gamki namv torbwngnama naalwk jidu. Vbvrikunamv, ngo ogugo mindu kudw hv Abu gv nga mintokv vla mimu namv.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwgv lvpa nga harkakto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>So si Vngbokunam Pumja aluv loma dwbv loochoyanv alu bv rito. Jisu ninyigv nyiamookua kayupikula okv Abu gvlo vngdwv aaduku vla chintoku. Nw nyiamooku so nw gvbvrinv vdwa alu gv dwkia arwng rungbv paktoku okv nw bunua ataranya alu lobv pakbwngre.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Jisu la ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv dvnam dvla doonyato. Uyudvbv ngv Saimon Iskeriot gv kuunyilo Judas Iskeriot gv haapok lo Jisunyi kubdubv mvnggv nvnv nga lwkro toku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Uyudvbv Jisu kulakuatvku; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Uyudvbv ngv mimbwktvku Simon iskeriot gv kuunyilo Judas, jisunyi kulakuariku</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Jisu Abu ninyia jwkrw mvnwngnga jilwk pvku vla chintoku; nw Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aanv ngv okv Pwknvyarnv gvlo vngtv rikunv vla chintoku. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Vkvlvgabv hv tvbul lokv dakrap toku, ninyigv agumlo vji a pilin toku, okv vbee vkv leit am puchingsito. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Vbvrikunamv nw gamla lo isi mego pwlwkto okv lvbwlaksu vdwgv lvpa vdwa harkak kakrap toku okv ninyigv leit lo puchingnam vbee lokv tipw toku. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Nw Saimon Pitar gvlo aatoku, Pitar ninyia mintoku, “Ahtu, no ngoogv lvpa nga harkak dubvi?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Jisu ninyia mirwkto, “No vjak chimare ngo ogugo ridung dunvdw, vbvritola no kokwngnyi chireku.”<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Pitar minbwk toku, “Vdwloka ogubv rijeka no ngoogv lvpa nga harkak maji nvngv!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jisu minrwkto “Ngo nonugv lvpa nga harkak mabolo, nonu ngoogv lvbwlaksubv rinyu mare.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Saimon Pitar mirwkto, “Ahtu, ngoogv lvpa mvngchik ka harkak mabv, vbvkubolo! ngoogv laak okv dumpo ngaaka harkak labv!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Jisu minto, “Yvv bunudw horsok sokro pvkunv bunu mvnwngngv darwk pvkunv okv bunu atuv harkak sise kaakuma, bunugv lvpa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">bunu mvngchikgv lvchu vmwng</char></note> vdwa mwngku. Nonu mvnwngngv darwk pvku—akin gomwng.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>Jisu chintoku yvvdw ninyia kubjinv angv; vkvlvgabv nw minto, “Mvnwngngv darwk pvku, akin gomwng.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:12-15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:27">Lk 22:27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jisu bunugv lvpa vdwa harkakro kochingbv nw ninyigv agum gv vji a pilwk sutoku okv ninyigv dooku tvbul lo aakur toku. Nw tvvkato, “Ngo vjak nonua ogugo ripvdw nonu chimpvre?” <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>“Nonu nga Ahtu okv Tamsarnv vla mindu, okv si rijwkkv nonu svbv rila, ogulvgavbolo ngo vbv rirungdo. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Ngo, nonugv Ahtu okv Tamsarnv, vjak nonugv lvpa vdwa harkakto. Vbvrikunamv, nonuka, akonv akonvgv lvpa nga harkak minsu laka. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Ngo nonua rimurilam jipvnv, nonua ngoogv nonua rinam apiabv rimu dubv vla. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mt 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Lk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Jn 15:20</ref></char></note>Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: pakbu hv ninyigv Atua kaiyama dunv, okv jokria nvngv ninyia kanamla vngmunv anga kaiyama dunv. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Vjak nonu so gv jvjv nga chindu, nonu achialvbv mvngpu reku sum nonu riying bolo!”<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Miri 41:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Ngo nonu mvnwngnga mima dunv; ngoogv darnam vdwa ngo chindu. Vbvritola Darwknv Kitaplo minam v jvjvbv rirungre ho mindu, ‘Nyi gunv ngoogv lvkobv dvbam dunv hv nga rinying riru duku.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>So si rilinla ritvmadvbv ngo vjak nonua mincho jidunv, ho nonu mvngjwng reku ‘Ngo Yvvdw Ngo.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mt 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Lk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note> Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: yvvdw ngoogv kanamla vngmunam akonyi naarwksidunv hv ngam naarwk tadunv; okv yvvdw ngam naarwksidunv hv ngam vngmunv ninyia naarwksitadunv.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyia koajinv nga mincho jitoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Jisu sum minro kochingbv, hv achialvbv mvngdwk mvngku lakula okv minlin toku, “Ngo jvjv nga nonua minjidunv: nonugv lokv akonv ngam koa tvduku.”<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Lwbwlaksu vdwv akonv akonyi kaagap minsuto, achialvbv abwkalo kuma toku yvvnyi mindu nvbvre vla. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Lwbwlaksu akonv, Jisu gv pakyachoknam angv, Jisunyi dochinsinvgo. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Saimon Pitar ninyia lakching ngv chigap lwngchingla mvto okv minto, “Ninyia tvvkato yvvnyi mindu nvbvre.”<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Vkvlvgabv ho lvbwlaksu angv Jisu gvlo hvngnwkto okv tvvkato, “Ahtu, hv yvvla?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Ngo vtwng mego naala bati lo nwkbok tvvla ninyia jire; hv nyi angv.” Vkvlvgabv nw vtwng patung achukgo naato, um nwkbok toku, okv Saimon Iskeriot gv kuunyilo Judasnyi jitoku. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Judas vtwng nga dvdanam gula Uyudvbv ngv baapubv nw gvlo aatoku. Jisu ninyi minto, “No ogugo ridung dudw baapubv ritoka!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Tvbul lo doonv kvvbi nyi vdwv chimato Jisu ninyia sum ogugbv minpv nvdw. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Judas morko bvngya nvgobv rikunam lvgabv, lvbwlaksu megonv Jisu ninyia Pumja gv lvgabv ogugo rvvmu tvbv vmalo heemanv vdwa ogugo jimu tvbv vngmupvnv go vla mvngto.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Judas vtwng nga naarwksuto okv vjakgobv agumbv lintoku. Ho kanv toku.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anw bv Gamkinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Judas gv vngro kochingbv, Jisu minto, “Vjak Nyia Kuunyilo gv kai nama kaapa duku; vjak nw gvlokv Pwknvyarnv gv kai nama kaapa duku. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Pwknvyarnv gv kai nammv nw gvlokv kaapa duku nvbolo, vbvrikunamv Pwknvyarnvnyi Nyia Kuunyilo gv kai nama ninyigv lokv kaatamre okv hv vbv vjakgobv rireku. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Jn 7:34</ref></char></note>Ngo gv kuu vdwa, ngo nonua kaigo lvkobv ribam kumare. Nonu nga kaakar reku; vbvritola ngo vjak nonua mindunv ngo oguaingbv Jius nyi kainv vdwa mindudw, ‘Ngo ogolo vngdudw nonu vngnyu mare.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Jn 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Jn 5</ref> </char></note>Okv ngo vjak nonua anwnv gamki gaamgo jidunv: ajin anyingnga pakmi sulaka. Ngoogv nonua paknam apiabv, vkvlvgabv nonuno pakmi sulaka, <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Nonu akonv akonvnga pakmi sibolo, vbvrikunamv nyi mvnwngngv chinreku nonu ngoogv lvbwlaksu v vla.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Pitar gv mvvse nga mincho jitoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mt 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Lk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Saimon Pitar ninyia tvvkato, “Ahtu, no ogolo vngtv dunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">Jisu mirwkto, “No vjak vngming gvnyu mare ngoogv vngkulo; vbvritola kokwnglo no nga vngming gvreku!”<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Pitar tvvkato, “Ahtu, ogulvgabv ngo vjak nam vngming gvnyu madubv?” “Ngo noogv lvgabv siso mvngdunv!”<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Jisu mirwkto, “No jvjvbv ngoogv lvgabv sidubv mvngpv pvnvre?” Ngo nam jvjv nga minjidunv: rokpuv koktv madvbv no ngam chima vla lvom go minre.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Lamtv ngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>“Mvngdwk mvngkula doomabvka,” Jisu bunua minto. “Pwknvyarnvnyi mvngjwng laka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mvngjwng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">no mngjwngre</char></note> okv ngaaka mvngjwng laka. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Ngo Abu gv naam tv karchung ngv awgo doodu, okv ngo nonugv lvgabv dooku riku mvpvripv jitebv vngjinv. Minggvdvnam si doorung mabolo ngo nonua svbv mima dvnvpv. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hokaku hvmabolo; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vmalo</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngo abugv naam tvlo karchung ngv achialgo doodu; hvbv domanvgo ilo ngo nunugv lvgabv dokudakku mvpvripv tvkubv vngji nvkv vla mimare?</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Okv ngo vngla nonugv lvgabv dooku riku nga mvpv ripvro kochingbv, ngo aakur reku okv ngo atuv nonua naareku, vbvrikubolo ngo ogolo doopvdw nonuka dooming gvreku. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Nonu chindu ngoogv vngjiku mooku lo vnglwknv lamtv nga.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomas ninyia minto, “Ahtu, ngonu chima noogv vngku lamtv nga; vkvlvgabv tolo chaalwk dubv oguaingbv ngonu lamtv nga chinyu dubv?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Jisu ninyia mirwkto, “Ngo lamtv ngv, jvjv ngv, okv turnammv; ngo gvlokv vngmabv yvvka Abu gvlo vngnyu mare. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Vjak nonu ngam chimpvku,” nw bunua minto, “Nonu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Vjak nonuno nga chindu nonu chinre; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nonu ngam chinvgoilo nonu chineku.</char></note> ngoogv Abu nyika chinreku, okv vjak gvlokv nonuka ninyia chireku okv nonu ninyia kaakw pvku.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Pilip ninyia minto, “Ahtu, Abunyi ngonua kaatam labv; si ngonu mvnwng gv mvngnamv.”<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Pilip, ngo nonua mvngchi kumanamgo lvkobv reming gvkwng kunam vka nonu ngam chimai?” Yvvdw ngam kaadudw hv Abu nyika kaadunv, vbvrikunamv ogulvgabv no Abunyi ngonua kaatam labv vla mindunv? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Ngo Abu gvlo doodu okv Abu ngoogvlo doodu um Pilip no mvngjwng madunvre? Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa mintoku, “Ngoogv nonua gaam minam dvdv ngv, ngo gvlokv aama. Abu, ngoogvlo doonv ninyigv ridung nga atuv ridunv. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Ngam mvngjwng laka ngo vdwlo abu ngoogvlo doodunv okv ngo Abu gvlo doodunv vla minam a. Ho malo, ngoogv rinam a kaagvrila mvngjwng tvka. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: yvvdw ngam mvngjwng dunv hv ngoogv rinam aingbv rire—am, hv kaiyanv goka rire, ogulvgavbolo ngo abu gvlo vngjinv. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Okv nonu ngoogv amin bv ogugo kooridw ngo rijire, Abu gv kairungnv jwkrw nga Kuunyilo gvlokv kaatam kunam lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Nonu ngoogv amin bv ngam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doomado</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ngam.</char></note> ogugo kooridw, ngo um rijire.”<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Darwknv Dow milv jinam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>“Nonu nga mvngjwng bolo, nonu ngoogv gamki nama tvjirijire. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Ngo Abunyi koore, okv hv nonua ridur rianv kvvbigo jire, hv nonua dvbvsvngtambv dooming gvvre. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Hv Dow hv Pwknvyarnv gv jvjv nga kaatam rianv. Nyiamooku v ninyia naarwk nyumare, ogulvgavbolo hv ninyia chima vmalo kaakwma. Vbvritola nonu ninyia chindu, ogulvgavbolo hv nonu gvlo lvkobv doobwngdu okv<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vma; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">vh mare.</char></note> nonu lo doodu.”<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Vdwlo ngo vngro jeka, nonua ngo opin jvbv doomu mare; ngo nonu gvlo aakur reku. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Nyia mooku hv ngam ayungjvma nga kaapa kumare, vbvritola nonu ngam kaare; ogulvgavbolo ngo turre, okv nonu ka turre. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Vdwlo ho aluv lori kudw, nonu chinre ngo Abu gvlo doodu, okv nonu ngoogvlo doodu, ngo oguaingbv nonu gvlo doodudw ho apiabv.”<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Yvvdw ngoogv gamki nama torwk sudunv okv um tvduridunv hv ngam paknvrinvbv ridunv. Yvvdw ngam pakdunv um ngoogv Abu pakre; ngooka ninyia paktare okv ngo atuv ninyia kaatam sure.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>(Judas Iskariotnyi miyamabv) Judas gunv minto, “Ahtu, no atuv ngonua kaatamre okv nyiamookua kaatam sumare, hv oguaingbv ritv dunv?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Jisu ninyia minrwkto, “Yvvdw ngam pakdunv hv ngoogv tamsar nama tvduridunv. Ngoogv Abu ninyia pakre, okv ngo la Abu ninyi gvlo aala lvkobv dooming gvvre. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Yvvdw ngam pakma dunv ngoogv tamsar nama tvvmarima dunv. Okv nonugv tvvnam ngoogv tamsar namv ngo gvngvma, vbvritola ngam vngmunv Abu gvlo naapvnv.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Ngo nonua minpvkunv nonuam lvkobv doodula. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Ridur rianv, Darwknv Dow, Abu gv ngo amin bv imu kujinam v, nonua tamsarre okv ngoogv nonua minam dvdv nga mvngpa more.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Nonua ngo sarsopoyo nama lvkobv kayu jido; so si ngo atugv sarsopvyo nama nonua jipvnv. Um ngo nyiamooku gv rinam aingbv jima. Mvngdwk mvngkula doomabvka; Busu mabvka. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Nonu ngam nonua ‘Ngo vngjinv, vdubv tvvdu, vbvritola ngo nonu gvlo aakur reku,’ nonu ngam pakdu bolo, ngoogv Abu gvlo vngnam ha nonu mvngpure; ogulvgavbolo hv ngam kaiyanv. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Ngo nonua mintam chodunv so gv ogumvnwng si ritv madvbv, vkvlvga vdwlo si rirekudw nonu mvngjwng reku. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Ngo nonua awgo raami sidubv rinyuma, ogulvgavbolo nyiamookua rigvdakgv nvngv aariku. Hvkvgv jwkrw ngv ngam rigum lamare, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>vbvritola nyiamookuv chirung laka ngo Abunyi pakdunv; vkvlvgalo ngo ogumvnwng ngam ridunv ninyigv ngam minam dvdv nga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Aatoka, klvi so mooku lokv vngla kuju.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Jvjvbv singnv hampo ngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>“Ngo singnv hampo ngv, okv ngoogv Abu nayam mvnv atuv. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Hv ngoogvlo hakbv asi svvma nvnga pala paa dunv, okv asi svvnv hakbv vdwa hv mvngi riadunv, vkvlvgavbolo abuyayabv asi svvmu dubv vla hv mvngi dunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Nonua mvngi ropvkunv (darwk dubv mvpvkunv) ngoogv nonua tamsar kolokv. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ngoogvlo doolwk laka, okv ngo ka nonu gvlo doolwkre. Hakbv ngv atuv asi svvnyu madunv; hakbv ngv asi svvlare vdwlo hv hampo nga hargap tvla dooridw. Vkv aingbv nonu asi svvnyu mare vdwlo nonu ngam rwkrwk mvla gakbwngla doomaredw.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Ngo hampo ngv, okv nonu hakbv ngv. Yvvdw ngam rwkrwk mvla gakbwng doonv, ngo ka ninyia, hv achialvbv asi svvre; ngam kayu tvla nonu oguka rinyu mare. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Yvvdw ngam gakbwng madunv (ngoogvlo doolwk madunv), hakbv nga mvnam apiabv ora dunv okv simudunv; vkvnv hakbv nga naakum dukunv okv vmvlo orlwk dukunv, hoka bunua vmv ramdu kunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Nonu ngoogvlo doobwng bolo okv ngoogv gamchar vdwv nonu gvlo doore, vbvrikunamv nonugv mvngnam lokv ogugo kooridw, nonu um paare. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Nonugv achialvbv asi svvku lokv ngo Abu gv kairungnam ha kaapa dunv; okv vbvrila nonu ngoogv lvbwlaksu bv ridunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Abu gv ngam paknam aingbv, ngo nonua pakdunv; ngoogv pakkulo doobwng laka. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Nonu ngoogv gamki nama tvboribolo, nonu ngoogv paknam lo doobwngre, ngo Abu gv gamki nama tvvla rila ninyigv paknam lo doobwng nam aingbv.”<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>“Ngo sum nonua mintam pvkunv, vkvlvgavbolo ngoogv mvngpuv nonu gvlo doolwk dubv okv nonugv mvngpuv achialv dukubv vla mindunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Jn 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Jn 5</ref> </char></note>Ngoogv gamki la minammv siinv: akonv akonyi pakmi sulaka, ngoogv nonua paknam aingbv. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Akonv ajin vdwgv lvgabv ninyigv turnama mvngnga jikunv v kaiyachokbv paknam jinamv. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Okv vdwlo nonu ngoogv gamki nama ribolo, nonu ngoogv ajin v. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Ngo nonua pakbu vla minku mare, ogulvgavbolo pakbuv chima ninyigv atuv ogugo ridudw. Vmabvya, ngo nonua ajin vla mindunv, ogulvgavbolo ngo vdwgo ngo Abu gvlo tvvpvkudw nonua mintam pvkunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Nonu ngam darma; ngo nonua darpvkunv okv vngla turbwngnv asi lokv achialvbv svvmudubv tolwk pvkunv, okv nonu ngoogv amin bv Abunyi ogugo kooredw nw nonua jire. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Vbvrikunamv, sum ngo gamki la mindunv: akonv akonyi pakmi sulaka.”<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyiamooku gv kaanwng manam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>“Nyiamooku hv nonua kaanwng madubolo, nonu mvngpa dalaka hv ngam kaanwng mabv richo dunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Nonu nyiamooku gvngvbolo, vbvrikunamv, nonua nyiamooku v atu gvngv vla pakdu nvpv. Vbvritola ngo nonua nyiamooku loka darpvkunv, okv nonu nyiamooku gvbv rikuma; vkvlvgabv nyiamookuv nonua kaanwng madunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mt 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Lk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref></char></note>Mvngpa laka ngo nonua ogugo minpvkudw: ‘pakbuv ninyigv atua kaiyama dunv.’ Bunu ngam mvdwkmvku bolo, bunu nonua ka mvdwkmvkure; bunu ngoogv tamsar nama tvvdu bolo, bunu nonua ka tvvre. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Vbvritola bunu nonua so mvnwng sum rire ogulvgavbolo nonu ngo gvngv; bunu ngam so imunv anga chima. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ngo bunu gvlo aala mima nvgoilo, bunu vdwloka chinsu mare bunu rimur nvngv vla; vjak vbvrikujeka, bunugv rimur gungnying nga vjak anyubv kayu laku mare. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Yvvdw ngam kaanwng madunv hv ngoogv Abu nyika kaanwng madunv. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Bunu rimurnvngv vla chinsu mapvnvpv, ngo bunu gvlo nyi gv rikw manam vdwa rima nvgolo; vbvdvdvbv, bunu kaato ngo ogugo ripvkudw, okv bunu ngam okv Abu ngunyia kaanwng madu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Miri 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note>Svbvrinam si bunugv Pvbv kitaplo ogugo lvkchola lvkpv pvdw um jvjvbv rilin monam lvgabv ripv, ho vbv lvkpv: ‘Bunu ngam oguguka gungnying kaamabv kaanwng madu.’”<verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Riduryanv aare—Dow v, hv Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aanv okv Pwknvyarnv gv jvjv nga kaatam mintam rianv. Ngo ninyia nonu gvlo vngmure, okv hv ngoogv lvkwng nga japjire. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Okv nonuka, ngoogv lvkwng nga japjire, ogulvgavbolo nonu ngam atuk lokv reming gvkunv.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Ngo nonua sum mintam pvkunv, vkvlvgavbolo nonuno mvngjwng nga topu madubv. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Nonua Jius vdwgv Kumkunaam loka naalin reku, okv vkvnv dw v aareku nyi gonv nonua mvki tokula Pwknvyarnv gv lvgabv ripvnv vla mvngsure. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Nyi vdwv nonua svbv rireku ogulvgavbolo bunu Abunyi vmalo ngaaka chima kunam lvgabv. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Vbvritola ngo nonua sum minjidunv, vkvlgavbolo vdwlo bunu so ridubv ridwv aarikudw, nonu mvngpa reku ngo nonua mintam jipvkunv vla.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Darwknv Dow gv kudungkua ngv</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Ngo nonua ribamnam lvgabv, kvvlo ngo soogv vdw sum nonua mintam mapvnv. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Vbvritola vjak ngo vngjikunv ngam vngmunv gvlo, vjakka nonugv lokv yvvka ngam ogolo vla tvvka nvgoka kaama. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Okv vjak ngo nonua mintam pvkunv, nonugv haapok hv mvngru yayabv ripvku. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Vbvritola ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: so si nonugv lvgabv alvyare ngo vngyu namv, ogulvgavbolo ngo vngma bolo, ridur rianv nonu gvlo aamare. Vbvritola ngo vngyu kubolo, ngo ninyia nonu gvlo vngmu reku. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Okv vdwlo hv aarikudw, hv nyiamooku gv nyi vdwa hinchinkaachin moreku, bunu vdwv rimurlo doodu kunvnyi vla, alv ngv oguvkudw, okv Pwknvyarnv gv jwngkadaka dw alu gv lvkwng nga hinchinkaachin reku. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Bunu rinying riru la rimurdu, ogulvgavbolo bunu ngam mvngjwng manam angv; <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Jvjv ngv oguvdw um rimayabv bunu rimurdu, ogulvgavbolo ngo Abu gvlo vngjikunv okv nonu ngam lvkodv kaapa kumare; <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Jwngkadaka gv lvkwnglo bunu mvngmur nyadu, ogulvgavbolo nyiamooku sum rigvnv vdwa jwngkadaka ropvkunv.”<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Ngo nonua minta sengv awgo doodu, vbvritola vjak nonu awyaje nga gvla mare. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Vdwlo Dow hv aarikudw, hv Pwknvyarnv gv jvjv nga kaatamre, hv nonua jvjv lo vnggvre, hv vdwloka hv atubongv tojupkunam jvbv minsumare vbvritola hv ogugo tvvpvdw um minre, okv aaji nvgv ogu-ogua nonua minpa jire. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Hv ngam yungnam gubv rimure, ogulvgavbolo hv ngoogv minam a naala nonua minjire. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Ngo Abu ogugo doodudw hv mvnwngngv ngokv, vkvlvgabv ngoogv minamv hvvnv Dow v ngo minam dvdv nga naala um nonua minjire.”<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngrunam okv Mvngpunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>“Achukgo ayungjvma nga nonu nga kaapa mare, okv achukgo ayungjvma gv kochinglo nonu nga kaapareku.”<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv bunugv aralo tvvka minsuto, “So gv minam si ogu gubvre? Hv ngonua mintamdu achukgo ayungjvma nga ngonu ninyia kaapamare, okv vbvrikunamv achukgo ayungjvma gv kochinglo ngonu ninyia kaapa reku; okv hv mintadu, ‘So si ogulvgavbolo ngo abu gvlo vngjikunv.’ <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Ogu gubvre so gv ‘achukgo ayungjvma nga’ vla minam si? Hv ogugonyi mindunvdw ngonu chima!”<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Jisu chintoku bunu ninyia tvu dubv mvngdu vla, vkvlvgabv nw bunua minto, “Ngo minto, ‘Achukgo ayungjvma nga nonu nga kaapamare, okv vbvrikunamv achukgo ayung jemagv kochinglo nonu nga kaapareku’ si re nonugv aralo tvvka minsu namv? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: nonu kapre okv ilokre, vbvritola nyiamookuv mvngpu puminre; nonu mvngrure, vbvritola nonugv mvngru runam v mvngpu gubv rilin reku. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Vdwlo nyimv gonv kuu bvngtv tvdudw, hv mvngrudu ogulvgavbolo ninyigv mvngru rudwv aakunam lvgalo; vbvritola vdwlo anga nga bvnglin rekudw, hv ninyigv hinching chingnam a mvngpa kumado, ogulvgavbolo hv anga nga nyiamooku so bvnglin pvku vla mvngpu duku. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Ho apiabv nonu gvloka: vjak nonu mvngrudu, vbvritola ngo nonua lvkodv kaapa minsureku, okv nonugv haapok lo mvngpu pulwk reku, vkvnv mvngpu gubv rire yvvka naala naa nyulamare.”<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>“Vdwlo hv aluv lori kudw nonu nga oguka kooku mare. Ngo nonua jvjv nga minjidunv: Abu nonugv ogugo kooridw ngoogv amin bv koonam a jire.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abu naa jirungre no vgugo ngo aminlokv kooredw; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplodoodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">no abunyi hogugo kooredw, nw nonua jireku</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Vjaklodvbv nonu ngoogv amin bv koonam kaama; kolaka okv nonu paare, vkvlvgavbolo nonugv mvngpuv punya mindu kubv.”<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyiamooku a rigumyanam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Nonua so vdw sum ngo minchisinam lokv minjito. Vbvritola vkvnv dw v aariku vdwlo ngo minchisinambv mima reku, vbvritola ngo Abu gv lvga nga nonua mindakvlabv minji reku. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Vdwlo ho aluv lori kudw, nonu ninyi ngo amin bv kooriku; okv ngo nonugv lvgabv ninyia koonvpv vla mima, <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>vkvlvgabv Abu nonua atubongv paksudu. Hv nonua pakdu ogulvgavbolo nonu ngam pakdu okv ngam Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aapvnv vla mvngjwngdu. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Ngo Abu gvlokv aarungpvnv, okv ngo nyiamooku so aalwk pvnv; okv vjak ngo nyiamooku kayupikula okv Abu gvlo vngjikunv.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Vbvrikunamv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia minto, “Vjak no minchisinam bv mimabv mindakvlabv mindu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Vjak ngonu chinduku no ogumvnwng nga chinv go; nam tvvu jinv guka no dinchi kuma. Svbvrinam si no Pwknvyarnv gvlokv aanv ngv vla ngonua mvngjwng modu.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Jisu bunua mirwkto, “Vjak nonu mvngjwng dukure? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Ngam akinbv kayu tvla, nonu atu atugv naam lo kiakkipak dw hv aariku okv si aaropvku. Vbvritola ngo akin vmwng ma, ogulvgavbolo abu nga reming gvdu. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Ngo nonua sum minpvkunv nonu ngam lvkobv relwk minggv tvla mvngpu pumin dubv. Nyia mooku hv nonua hinching chingmure. Vbvritola mvngpak nvgobv ritolaka! Ngo nyiamookua rigum yapvkunv!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwgv lvgabv kumtoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Jisu sum minro kochingbv, nw nyidomookubv kaadungto okv minto, Abu, dw v aapvku. Noogv Kuunyilo nga amina yunglit molaka, vkvlvgavbolo Kuunyilo ngvka noogv amina kaiyachok mola jidukubv. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>No nyiamookua rigv dubv tojupkunam ha ninyia jito, vkvlvgavbolo nw noogv jinam a bunua turbwng nvnga jidubv. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Okv turbwngnv singnam manv nam jvjvrungnv Pwknvyarnv akin vla chinam, okv Jisunyi no vngmu kunamv vla chinam. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>Ngo nyiamooku so noogv amin kai nama kaatam pvkunv; noogv ritokv vla ridung jinama ngo rinya pvkunv. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Abu! Nyia mooku ha pwklin yarlin madvbv noogv ngam amin kai dubv jinam aingbv. Vjakka no gv nvchilo ngam amin kai dubv jilabvka.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>Nyia mooku so noogv ngam jinam vdwa noogv amina ngo bunua chimupvnv. Bunu no gvngvku okv no bunua ngam jito. Bunu noogv gamchar vdwa tvvpvripvku, <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>okv vjak bunu chimpvku noogv ngam ogumvnwng jinam vdwa no gvlokv aanv ngv vla. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Ngo noogv jinam doin ha bunua jipvkunv, okv bunu larwksupvku; bunu ngam noogv lokv jvjvbv aanv ngv vla chindu, okv ngam no vngmu pvnv vla bunu mvnjwngdu.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Ngo bunugv lvgabv kumdunv. Ngo nyiamooku gv lvgabv kumma vbvritola noogv ngam jinam vdwgv lvgabv, bunu no gvbv ripvku. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Ngoogvlo ogugo doopvdw mvnwngngv no gvngv, okv noogv ogu mvnwngngv ngokvku; okv ngoogv amin kai nama bunugv lokv kaatam pvnv. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Okv vjak ngo no gvlo chaarikunv; ngo nyiamooku so doobwng kumare, vbvritola bunu nyiamooku si doopv. Darwknv Abu! Noogv amin jwkrw lokv bunua alv dubv toryagaya laka, noogv nga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nogv amin jwkrwlokv bunua ringlaka, nogv nga aminjiku nama; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Noogv jwkrw aminlokv ringlaka nogv nga jinam bunu vdwa</char></note> amin jinam a vkvlvgavbolo bunuv akin gubv ridu kubv no la ngo oguaingbv akinpvdw vkv aingbv. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ngo bunua ringdunv nogv jwkrw amin lokv, nogv nga amin jinama; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nogv amin jwkrw lokv nogv vdwa ngo ringpvnv</char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Miri 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Jn 13:18</ref></char></note>Bunua ngoogv lvkobv doorilo, no gv ngam amin jinam, ho gv jinam amin jwkrw lokv ngo bunua turlingalin pvkunv, Darwknv kitap lokv minam gaam hv rilin kunam lvgabv nyidum akin go ngerung jinv nga mimabv ngo bunugv lokv akin goka ngemu mato. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Okv vjak ngo no gvlo aariku, okv ngo nyiamooku soogv ogu ogu vdwa mindunv vkvlvga bunu gvlo ngoogv mvngpuv bunugv haapok vdwlo kaibv doolwk modubv. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>Ngo bunua noogv doin a jipvnv, okv nyiamookuv bunua kaanwng mado, ogulvgavbolo bunu nyiamooku gvngv kuma, ngoogv nyiamooku gvngv manam apiabv. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Ngo bunua nyiamooku so doonv nga naarotvka vla mima, vbvritola bunua Alvmanv loka toryagaya laka vla mindunv. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Ngo gv nyiamooku gvngv manam apiabv bunu nyiamooku gvngv kuma. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Noogv gaam v jvjvrungnv; jvjvnv gaam lokv no bunua no gvbv jvjv dukubv mvsulaka. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>No oguaingbv ngam nyiamooku so vngmupvdw, vkv aingbv ngo bunua nyiamooku so vngmupvnv. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Okv ngo bunugv lvgabv ngo atuv no gvlo tolwk sudunv, ho apiabv bunuka no gvlo jvjvbv tolwk sidukubv.”<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mvngjwngnv mvnwng gv lvgabv Jisu kumtoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Ngo bunu mvngchik lvgabv kumma, vbvritola bunugv doin lokv nga mvngjwngnv vdwgv lvgabvka kumdunv. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>Bunu mvnwngnga akin molaka vla ngo kumdunv. Abu! no ngoogvlo okv ngo no gvlo vkv aingbv bunuaka ngonu gvlo akin motoka, okv nyiamooku so gv nyi vdwv no kunyi nga vngmunv vla chindubv. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>No okv ngo oguaingbv akinpvdw, vkv aingbv bunuaka akin modubv vla, no gv jinam yunglit nama ngo bunua jipvnv. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Ngo bunu gvlo okv no ngoogvlo, vkvlvgavbolo bunu mvnwngngv akin dukubv, nyiamookuv no ngam vngmunv vla chinam lvgabv okv no gv ngam paknam apiabv bunua no pakdu kubv.”<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Abu no bunuam ngam jito, okv ngo ogolo dooredw bunuaka ngoogvlo doomu nvpv mvngdu, noogv nga yunglit dubv jinama ngooka bunua ngoogv yunglit nama kaatam dukubv ogulvgavbolo nyiamookua pwklinyarlin madvbv no ngam pakpvnv. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Daadwvrwnv Abu! Nyia mooku v nam chima vbvritola ngo nam chindu, okv si bunu no nga vngmunv vla chindu. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>Ngo nam bunua chimu dukubv mvpvnv, okv ngo vbvdvdvbv ribwngre, vkvlvgabv no gv ngam paknamv bunu gvlo doolwk dukubv.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi naatung kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mt 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Lk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Jisu gv so kumro kochingbv, hv okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa vnggvla Kidron svko vnamha vngpikto. Okv hoka mooku hoka nayam ako dooto, Jisu la okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwv ho aalwkto <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Judas, kupnv angv, chinto hv ogolodw, ogulvgavbolo Jisu hoka ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa lvkobv kaarwk subvto. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Vkvlvgabv Judas Nayam arwngbv vngtoku, ninyigv vngkulo Roman sipai apum go vnggvto, okv nyibu butvnv okv Parisi vdwgv vngmunam Pwknvyarnvnaam a kaayanv nyi mego; bunu ho yidu naalayila okv mvdurupum okv horkanvnv bvngnyato. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Jisu ninyia ogugo ritv tvvdukudw mvnwngnga chintoku, vkvlvgabv nw bunugv dookulo korlwk yadula tvvkato, “Nonugv kaakar namv Yvvnyila?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Bunu mirwkto, “Najaret lokv Jisunyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Nw minto, “Hvvdv ngoonv.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Judas, kupnv angv, hoka bunua lvkobv dakto. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Vdwlo Jisu bunua “Ngo kuna nw” vla minto kudw, bunu koching kyambv tapkurla kvdwlo gipv nyato. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Lvkodv Jisu bunua tvvkato, “Nonuno Yvvnyila kaakar dunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Bunu mirwkto, “Najaret lokv Jisunyi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>“Ngo nonua minpvkunv ngoonv nw,” vla Jisu minto. “Vbvrikunamv, nonu nga kaakar dunvlo, so kvvbi vdw sum vngmulak.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>Nw sum minto ho lvga ninyigv minam a jvjvbv rimu dubv vla: “Abu no gv ngam jinam vdwa ngo akin goka ngemu mare.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Saimon Pitar gvlo riokse ako dooto, seelin dabonv okv Butvyachok nvgv nyira gv, nyarung rungbik ka palujito, pakbu nyarung palu namgv aminv Malkus. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mt 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Lk 22:42</ref> </char></note>Jisu Pitarnyi minto, “No gv riokse nga selin kolo selwk tokuka! No ngam ngo Abu gv hinching koobu tvngdubv jinam ha tvngma jinvgo vla mvngdunvre?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Annas gv kaagia lo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Vbvrikunamv Roman sipai vdwv bunugv mirianv nyigam okv Jius dakrianv vdwa lvkobv Jisunyi naatungla ninyia leetoku, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>okv ninyia Annas gvlo aacho gvtoku. Annas Kaipas gv nywng gv abuv, Kaipas ho anying gv Butvyachok kv. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Jn 11:49</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref></char></note>Kaipas mabvdv Jius vdwa, nyi mvnwng gv lvgabv nyi akin gonv siria namv alvyanv vla minv.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar Jisunyi chimakv vkunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Saimon Pitar okv kvvbi lvbwlaksu ako Jisunyi vngming gvto. Kvvbi lvbwlaksu angv Butvyachoknyi alvbv chimisuto, vkvlvgabv Jisunyi lvkobv kvba baaku Butvyachok gv naam lo aatoku. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Vdwlo Pitar agum gv agi aagialo dakto kudw, kvvbi lvbwlaksu angv agumbv lingkur laku agi ho daknv nyijar anga minla Pitarnyi arwngbv aamu toku. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Agi gv nyijar angv Pitarnyi minto, “No ka nyi angv gv lvbwlaksu gomabvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Pitar mirwkto, “Ma, ngo ma.”<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Ho svkarto, vkvlvgabv pakbu vdwvla okv dakrianv vdwv mvri vkv vmv partola okv um dakyum nyatokula, iguminla doonya toku. Vkvlvgabv Pitar bunu gvlo aala lvkobv iguminla dakbamto.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Nyibu Butvyachoknv angv tvu toku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mt 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Lk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Butvyachoknv Jisunyi ninyigv lvbwlaksu okv ninyigv tamsarnam gv lvkwngbv tvuto. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Jisu mirwkto, “Ngo alu gv lokia nyichar mvnwng gv okv kvba vdwgv tvvku kaaku lo minpvnv; ogolo nyi vdwv aakum dvdw Jius kumkunaamlo, okv Pwknvyarnvnaam lo ngoogv tamsar a sarpv kunv. Ngo vdwloka minsi minpikla mimapvnv. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Vbvrikunamv no ngam ogulvgabv tvu dunv? Ngoogvlo tvvnv nyi vdwa tvu toka. Tvvkalaka ngo bunua ogugo minpvdw—bunu chindu ngo ogugo mimpvkudw.”<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Vdwlo Jisu sum minto kudw, hoka dakrianv akonv Jisunyi svbiakseriak mvtoku okv minto, “No Butvyachoknyi busu mabv ogubv vbv gaam mindunv!”<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Jisu ninyia mirwkto, “Ngo mimur go minpv bolo, hv ogu gudw so nyi vdwsum minpa toka. Vbvritola ngoogv minam hv minjwk pvbolo, no ngam ogulvgabv dvngdunv?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Annas ninyia vjaklodvbv leekor bwngtola Butvyachoknv Kaipas gvlo vngmu toku.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pitar lvkodv Jisunyi chimakv vla minto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mt 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-70">Mk 14:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Lk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Pitar hoka vjaklodvbv atuv igula doobwngto. Vkvlvgabv kvvbi gonv ninyia minto, “No ka alo nyi angv gv lvbwlaksu guma bri?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Vbvritola Pitar um miasula minto, “Ma ngo ma.”<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Butvyachok gv nyira ako Pitar gv nyarung palu namgv agungarum nyi go minto, “Nam ngo alo nyi anga Nayamlo lvkobv ridubv kaama pvnvre?” vla nw tvkato.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Pitar lvkodv mindvto, “Ma”—vla minda sopikda rokpu v koktoku.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi Pilot gvlo boolwk kunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mt 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Lk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Arukamchi bv Jisunyi Kaipas gv naam loka gobunor gv opislo vnggv toku. Jius nyi kainv vdwv naam arwngbv aama toku, bunu vngbokunam Pumja nga dvnyu dubv vla darwk dubv mvsure vla mvngla rinyato. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Vkvlvgabv Pilot agum bv linla bunua tvvkato, “Ogu gula nonu so nyi angv sum gungnying lwkla mindunv?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Bunugv mirwknamv “Hv rimur mimor rima nvgolo ngonu ninyia no gvlo aagv mapvnvpv.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilot bunua minto, “Vbvribolo nonuno atuv ninyi naalaila nonugv Pvbv gv alambv kaala risu tvka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Bunu mirwksito, “Ngonua nyi mvkidubv jima pvnv.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Jn 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref> </char></note> Svbvrinam si Jisu gv nw oguaingbv rila sitv rinvdw um gaam minchola ninyigv minpv nama rilin modubv rito.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilot opis arwngbv aakur toku okv Jisunyi goklwkto. Nw Jisunyi tvvkato, “No Jius vdwgv dvbv ngvre?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Jisu mirwkto, “So gaam si no atubongv minsu dvnvre vmalo kvvbi gonv ngo lvga nga nam mintam pvnvre?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilot mirwksito, “No ngam Jiu go vla mvngdunvre? No ogugo ripv nvla? Noogv Atunyi vdwvla nyibu butvnv vdwv nam ngoogvlo laklwknv.”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Jisu minto, “Ngoogv Karv ngv nyiamooku si ma; nyiamooku si ngoogv karv bv rinv guilo, ngoogv rigvnam vdwv ngam Jius kainv vdwgv laak lo laklwk momabv padar minsu pvnvpv. Ma, ngoogv karv ngv soka ma!”<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Vkvlvgabv Pilot ninyia tvvkato, “Vbvrinamv no dvbv ngvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jisu mirwkto, “No nga dvbv akobv minggv nyibv. Ngo so lvgabv nyiamooku so ila bvnglin kopvnv, jvjvgv lvga nga mindubv. Yvvbunudw jvjvlo doodunv nga tvya dunv.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilot tvkato, “Jvjv ngv oguv?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jisunyi simu dukubv minkunam</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mt 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Vbvrikunamv Pilot nyi vdwgvlo agum bv linkur toku okv bunua mintoku, “Ngo so nyi sum mia dubv gungying paanyu ma. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Vbvritola nonugv Pvbv gv alam lokv, vngbo pumja lo patwklo tumla vvpvnam nyi akonyi anyubv ngo nonugv lvgabv tulin jibwng dunv. Nonu nga Jius vdwgv dvbv nga anyubv tulin dukubv mvngdure?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Bunu gamtvbv gokla mirwkto, “Ma, nw nyima! Ngonu Barabasnyi mvngdunv!” (Barabas gwngrw gwnv nyi go.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Vbvrikunamv Pilot Jisunyi naatoku okv dvngdar pamuto. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Sipai vdwv tv doonv hakbv vkv naala biotung bv mvtola okv um ninyigv dumpolo pilwkto; vbvrikunamv bunu vji pakria go ninyia pilwk tato <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>okv nw gvlo aala minto, “Jius vdwgv dvbv ngv turbwng laka!” Okv bunu nw gvlo chaala svbiakseriak mvtoku.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilot lvkodv agum linkurla okv nyipam a minto, “Kaatoka, ngo ninyia mia dubv gungnying mapa nyuma vla nonua kaamu dubv ngo ninyia nonu gvlo agum lo limu gvrinvla.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu agumbv lintoku, tvv biotung hala vji pakria nga gvtokula. Pilot bunua mintoku, “Kaatoka! nyi angv so si kunv!”<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Vdwlo nyibu butvnv vdwv okv kumkunaam a kaayanv vdwv ninyia kaatokudw, bunu goktoku, “Daapo lo ninyia takkito! Daapo lo ninyi takkito!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilot bunua minto, “Vbvrikunamv, nonu ninyi naala okv Daapo lo ninyi takki toka. Ngo ninyia mia dubv gungnying mapa yama.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Nyipam v minkurla mirwkto, “Ngonu pvbv go doosudo hv mindu ninyi kua jinvku, ogulvgavbolo hv atuv Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo gubv minsudo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Vdwlo Pilot sum tvvtokudw nw abuyayabv busuto. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>Nw opis arwngbv aakur toku okv Jisunyi tvvkato, “No ogolokv aapvnv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Vbvritola Jisu mirwk matoku. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilot ninyia minto, “No ngam raarwk suma dubvre? Mvnggap laka ngoogvlo nam anyubv tulin dubv okv daapo loka takki modubv rigvnvnv doodunv.”<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Jisu mirwkto, “No ngam vbv mvngchik rilanvnv doodunv ogulvgavbolo Pwknvyarnv nam um jipvnv. Vkvlvga yvvdw ngam no gvlo laklwk pvdw hv achialvbv rimur gungnying gvyachoknv.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Vdwlo Pilot sum tvvtokudw, nw Jisunyi anyubv tulin dukubv lamtv makar kwto. Vbvritola nyipam hv gokla mindvto, “No ninyia anyubv tulin kubolo, hv manv no Dvbvyachok gv ajin kumanyi! yvvdw dvbv gubv minsu dunv hv Dvbvyachoknyi rinyingriru dunv!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Vdwlo Pilot so gaam sum tvvpa tokudw, nw Jisunyi agumlo linggv toku okv jwngkadakaku “Dooging Lvngnv” vnamlo doolwk toku (Um Hebru gaam bv “Gabbatha” vla minto.) <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Vbvrikunamv ho alu hv Vngbokunam pumja nga loochoyanv alu lopo bv ritoku. Pilot nyi vdwa mintoku, “Siinv nonugv dvbv ngv!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Bunu gokla mindvto, “Ninyia mvkito! Ninyia mvkito! Daapo lo ninyia takkito!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilot bunua tvvkato, “Nonu ngam nonugv dvbv nga daapo lo takki tvkv vla mvngdu ai?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Nyibu butvnv vdwv mirwkto, “Dvbvyachok mvngchik ngonugv dvbv ngv!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Vbvrikunamv Pilot Jisunyi daapo lo takki modukubv bunu gvlo laklwk toku.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Jisunyi Daapo lo takki kunam</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mt 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Lk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Vkvlvga bunu Jisunyi vnggv toku. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Nw agumbv vnglintoku ninyigv daapo nga bakto kula “Dumku gv mooku” vnam moodw putung (Um Hebru gaam bv “Golgota” vla minam) golo aalwk toku. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Hoka bunu ninyia daapolo takki toku; okv kvvbinyi anyi goka Jisu gv taggotaksak bv takkito. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilot minpanam gaamgo lvktola um daapolo takgap lwkmuto, ninyigv lwknammv, “Najaret lokv Jisu Jius vdwgv Dvbv ngv,” vla lvkto. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Nyi mvnwngngv um purinyato, ogulvgavbolo Jisunyi daapo lo takkiku hv pamtv lokv adu mato. Minpanam gaam lvkpvnam hv Hebru, Letin, Grik gaam bv lvktoku. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Nyibu butv vdwv Pilotnyi minto, “Jius vdwgv Dvbv ngv vla lvkma bvka vmabvdv, ‘So nyi angv si ngo Jius vdwgv Dvbv ngv vla minsupvnv.’”<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilot mirwkto, “Ngo ogugo lvkpv kudw vbv lvknam bv doomure.”<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Sipai vdwgv Jisunyi daapo lo takkiro kochingbv, bunu ninyigv vji ha naatoku okv um bunu takpi gobv putakpuyak mvtola sipai akin-akinnv asak gobv orpin-oryin sitoku, bunu arwnglo vji hammabv chumnam haka naatoku. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Miri 22:18</ref></char></note> Sipai vdwv akonv akonyi mimisuto, “Sum putak mabvju; klvi ngonu vlwng likwsulaju yvvdw sum paaji bongv.” Svbvrinam si Darwknv kitaplo minam a jvjvbv rilin modubv ritoku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Bunu ngoogv vji a orpin oryin sunyato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">okv ngoogv vji achar lvgabv limin likwsunyato.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Okv sum vbvchingching sipai vdwv ritoku.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Jisu gv daapo lo nvchibv daknv vdwv ninyigv anv, ninyigv anv gv bormv, Klopas gv nyimv Meri, okv Meri Magdalene. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Jisu ninyigv anvnyi okv ninyigv paknam lvbwlaksu gunyi hoka dakdubv kaagapto; vkvlvgabv nw ninyigv anvnyi minto, “Hv noogv kuunyilo ngv.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Vbvrikunamv nw lvbwlaksu anga minto, “Hv no gv anv ngv.” Ho dw lokv lvbwlaksu angv ninyia vnggv lakula ninyigv naam lo doomu toku.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv sikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mt 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Lk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 69:21">Miri 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char>
    </note>Jisu chintoku vjak ogumvnwng nga rinya pvku vla, okv Darwknv kitap nga jvjv monam lvgabv nw minto, “Ngo tvngnwng pv.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Hoka upum gulo, opo kungsuk nvkv yarbing dubv dooto; vkvlvga svngchak ka opolo nwkbok tvla, um tabiu karda daagolo mvlwk tvla okv um Jisu gv naptwng gaam lo nwkjito. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Jisu opo nga tvngto kula mintoku, “Si rinya ngvku!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Vbvrikunamv nw dumpo ngv bawng tuku okv sitoku.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu gv hubyam a nwkko toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Vbvrikunamv Jius nyi kainv vdwv daapo lo takkinam nyi vdwa lvpa nga svtar svbar momu labv vla Pilotnyi kooto, okv svma vdwa daapo loka naalu dukubv vla. Bunu vbv kooto, ogulvgavbolo ho aluv Jius vdwgv doonu alua loochoyanv gubv rito, okv bunu svma vdwa jius Doonualu lobv doolin modubv mvngmato, ogulvgavbolo aarinv Jius Doonualuv achialvbv darwk nvgo. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Vkvlvgabv sipai vdwv vngla Jisunyi lvkobv daapo lo takkinam vdwa akonyi mvsolaila akonyi lvpa vdwa svtar svbar mvtoku. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Vbvritola vdwlo bunu Jisu gvlo aatokudw, bunu ninyia sidubv kaatoku, vkvlvga bunu ninyigv lvpa nga svtar svbar mvmato. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Sipai akonv nvvbung lokv Jisu gv hubyam lo nwklwkto okv vjakgobv oyi bvla isi bv toolinto. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Vbvridubv kaanv angv ho lvkwngbv mintoku, minam gv lvga ngv nonuaka mvngjwng modukubv vla, ninyigv minammv jvjv ngv, okv hv chindu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:35 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mvngjwng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mvngjwng dvdvlakv.</char></note>nw jvjv nga mindu vla. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Mog 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Num 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Miri 34:20</ref></char></note> Svbvrinam si Darwknv kitap nga jvjv modubv vla ritoku: “Ninyigv loobung akoka dartung ma.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Jek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Nyikrw 1:7</ref> </char></note> Okv Darwknv Kitap kvvbi loka mindo, “Yvvnyi bunu nwkpv kudw nyi vdwv ninyia kaagap reku.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisunyi nyibung riikunam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mt 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Lk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>So kochingbv, Josep, Arimatia banggu lokv nw Jisu gv svma nga naaku nvpv vla Pilotnyi kooto. (Josep risila Jisunyi reming gvnvgubv rito, ogulvgavblo nw Jius nyi kainv vdwa busuto.) Pilot ninyia svma nga naalado vla mintoku, vkvlvgabv Josep vngla okv um naaro jitoku. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Jn 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note> Nikodemas, yvvdw kvvlo Jisunyi ayubv kaarwk sudubv aanv angv, hv mairrh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mairrh okv aloe vnam si awlo nampu dubv piaknam (sent) go si achialvbv arv doonv ngv</char></note> okv aloe mvyomvchila amok nampunv vkv keji chaamgo gvla Josepnyi lvkobv vngming gvto. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Nyi anyiv Jisu gv svma nga naatoku, okv vji koopa lo amok nampu nvnga lvkobv kvlap toku, Jius vdwv svma riiji nama oguaingbv mvla riidudw ho rilambv riitoku. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Jisunyi ogolo mvki pvkudw hoka mooku hoka nayam ako dooto, okv hoka ho svma magoka lwkw manam anwnv nyibung bunggo dooto. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Ho alu hv Jius doonu alua loochoyanv alu bv rito, okv ogulvgavbolo nyibung ngvka nvchilo doopv, bunu Jisu gv svma nga hoka dvpv toku.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Nyibung ngv Arochoko toku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Vjwngalu gv arukamchi bv, kanv ngv doodv dubv, Meri Magdalene nyibung lo vngto okv aagiagv vlwng nga naala naa rodubv kaapa toku. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Nw Saimon Pitar okv Jisu gv paknam kvvbi lvbwlaksu vdwgvlo riolwk toku, okv bunua minpa jitoku, “Bunu Ahtunyi nyibung loka naaropvku vla, okv ngonu chima ogolo bunu ninyia vvpvpvkudw!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Vbvrikunamv Pitar la okv kvvbi lvbwlaksu angv nyibung bv vngtoku. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Bunyi anyiv rioba sito, vbvritola kvvbi lvbwlaksu angv Pitarnyi riogo yala nyibung lo riochi choyato. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Hv gubwngto okv kaanammv vji koopa kvlap nvnv nga kaapato, vbvritola hv arwngbv aamato. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Ninyigv adar lo Saimon Pitar aatoku, okv nw arwngbv jokdajokrayato. Nw kvlap nvnv vji koopa nga ho doodubv kaatoku <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>okv Jisu gv dumpo nga heebum nvnv vjiv kvlap nvnv vji a lvkobv doomato, vbvritola achikaik tvvla doosuto. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Vbvrikunamv kvvbi lvbwlaksu nyibunglo aachi choyanv angvka arwngbv aatoku; hv kaatokula okv mvngjwng toku. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Bunu vjaklodvbv Darwknv kitaplo hv sinam lokv turrap rungreku vnama chima bwngto. <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Vbvrikunamv lvbwlaksu vdwv naambv vngkur nyatoku.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu Meri Magdalenenyi kaatam sutoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mt 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Meri nyibung gv agumlo kapla daktoku. Nw vbv kapdung rilo, nw gubwngla okv nyibung arung nga kaabungto <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>okv nyido gindung anyigo vji yapung tojinv kotola Jisunyi vvpvku hoka doodubv kaatoku, akonv dumpo dooku kyambv okv akonv lvpa dooku kyambv, <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>“Nyimv, ogubv kapdunv?” Vla bunu ninyia tvvkato.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Nw mirwksito, “Bunu ngoogv Ahtunyi naaropvku, okv ngo chima bunu ninyia ogolo vvpvpvkudw!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Vbvrikunamv nw dakkurdakjur namv Jisunyi hoka dakdubv kaapa toku; vbvritola nw um Jisu kv vla chimato. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>“Nyimv, no ogubv kapdunv?” Jisu ninyia tvvkato. “No Yvvnyila kaakar dunv?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Nw um nayam kaaya nvgo vla ninyia mvngto, vkvlvgabv nw ninyia mintoku, “No ninyia naaropvnvbolo, tamsarnv, nga minpalabv no ninyia ogolo vvpv pvnvla, ngo vngla ninyia naaku nvpvla.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Jisu ninyia mintoku, “Meri!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Nw dakrwk toku ninyigv takbv okv Hebru gaam bv minto, “Rabboni!” (So minam si “Tamsarnv.”)<verse eid="JHN 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “Ngam mvsit mabvka, ogulvgavbolo ngo vjaklodvbv Abu gvlo chaakorla chaalin madv. Vbvritola vngnyila ngoogv boru vdwa minpa jiteka ngo ngo Abu okv bunugv Abu bv rikunv gvlo okv ngoogv Pwknvyarnv okv bunugv Pwknvyarnvbv rikunv gvlo vngkur jikunv.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Vkvlvgabv Meri Magdalene vngtoku okv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa minpa jitoku nw Ahtunyi kaapv nvkv vla okv ninyigv bunua minam vdwa hv mintam jitoku.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kaatam sutoku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mt 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Vjwngalu gv arium riumdwng bv, okv lvbwlaksu vdwv bunu adarai lo agi a koktum sutola lvkobv dookum nyato, ogulvgavbolo bunu Jius nyi kainv vdwa busu nyato. Vbvrikunamv Jisu aatoku okv bunu gvlo daktoku. Nw minto, “Sarsopoyo ngv nonu gvlo lvkobv doolwk laka.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Vbv miro kochingbv, nw ninyigv laak okv hubyam a bunua kaatam toku. Lwbwlaksu vdwv Jisunyi kaatokula achialvbv mvngpu nyatoku. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Jisu bunua lvkodv mindvto, “Sarsopoyo ngv nonu gvlo lvkobv doolwk laka. Abu gv ngam vngmunam apiabv ngo nonua vngmu dunv,” <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Vbvrikunamv nw bunu gvlo saklwk toku okv minto, “Darwknv Dow ha naarwk silaka. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mt 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note> Nonu nyi vdwgv rimur a mvngnga jibolo, bunuaka mvngnga jireku; nonu bunua mvngnga mabolo, bunuaka mvngnga mare.”<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Tomas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Lwbwlaksu vring gola anyi lokv akin gonv, Tomas (Bvngpiam sinam vla minam) Jisu gv bunu gvlo aarilo hoka bunua lvkobv doomato. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Vkvlvgabv kvvbi lvbwlaksu vdwv, “Ngonu Ahtunyi kaapv kunv!” vla ninyia mintamto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomas bunua minto, “Ngo vdwlo ninyigv laak lokv kili taknam ungv nga kaala ngoogv lakching ngv chilwk maredw, ngo mvngjwng mare.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Alu lokkanw kochingbv lvbwlaksu vdwv lvkodv agi a koktum tvvla doobam nyato, okv Tomas bunua lvkobv doobam toku. Agi a mvtum toku, vbvritola Jisu aato okv bunua lvkobv dakto okv minto, “Sarsopoyo namv nonua lvkobv doolwk laka.” <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Vbvrikunamv nw Tomasnyi minto, “Ngoogv laakka kaato kuka, okv noogv lakching ngv chilwk tvkuka; vbvrikunamv noogv lak v ilinla okv ngoogv hubyam so mamkato. No gv mvngjwng mabv rinam a kayu tokula hoka mvngjwng tokuka!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomas ninyi mirwk toku, “Ngoogv Ahtu okv ngoogv Pwknvyarnv!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Jisu ninyia minto, “No ngam kaakunam lvgabv mvngjwng duku ai? Vdwgo mvngpu vku yvvdw ngam kaamabv mvngjwng dunv!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kitap so gv lvkwng ngv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwgv kaagia lo Jisu kvvbi lamrwpanam vkv achialvgo kaatamto um so kitap so lvkgap pvma. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Vbvritola so lvkgap pvvnam vdw so gv lvkwng ngv nonua Jisunyi Kristo, Pwknvyarnv gv Kuunyilo ngv vla mvngjwng <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mvngjwng; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Megonv kitaplo doodu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mvngjwng dvdvlaka .</char></note>modukubv, okv nonugv vbv ninyi mvngjwng kolokv nonu turbwng nama paadu kubv.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu lvbwlaksu kanw a kaatam sutoku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>So kochingbv Jisu lvkodv Tiberias Svpar lo ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kaarwksuto. Si vbvchingbv ritoku. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Saimon Pitar, Tomas (Bvngpiam sinam vla minam), Natanael (Hv Galili gv Kana lokv), Jibedi gv kuunyilo vdwv, okv Jisu gv kvvbi lvbwlaksu anyiv la mvnwngngv lvkobv dookumtoku. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Lk 5:5</ref></char></note> Saimon Pitar kvvbi vdwa minto, “Ngo ngui naabv vngjinnv.” Bunu ninyia minto, “Ngonuka nam vngming gvvre.” Vkvlvgabv bunu svpw akolo vnglin nyatoku, vbvritola bunu ho ayu mvnwngngv hoka oguka harpa kumato. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Doonyi hv nyilin sopit pvngnga, Jisu isi biyarlo daktoku, vbvritola lvbwlaksu vdwv ninyia Jisu vla chimato. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Vbvrikunamv hv bunua tvvkato, “Yaapa vdwa, nonu oguka harpa malare?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Bunu mirwkto, “Aaro, oguka naama.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:6">Lk 5:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nw bunua minto, “Nonugv vsap a svpw hokv lakbik takbv orlwk kwto, okv nonu mego naare.” Vkvlvgabv bunu bunugv vsap a orlwk toku okv um pukorla pulwk nyuma toku, ogulvgavbolo achialvbv ngui naakunam lvgabv.<verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Jisu gv paknam lvbwlaksu angv Pitarnyi minto, “Si Ahtu laka!” Vdwlo Pitar Ahtu vla tvvpa tvkudw, hv ninyigv agum vji a koorum sutoku (hv ninyigv vji a pilinla vvpv kunam um) okv isi bv poklwk toku. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Kvvbi lvbwlaksu vdwv svpw lokv agumbv dulunlinla vsaplo ngui yarpok kunam a puming gvto. Bunu agum gv kvdw a adu jeyo kumato, mitar lwngkin gubv adu to. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Vdwlo bunu agum kvdwlo korlin tokudw, bunu vtwng vkvla ngui go vmv mvri lo baalwk tvla doodubv kaapato. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Vbvrikunamv Jisu bunua minto, “Nonugv vjakpi ngui naanam lokv mego bvnglwkto.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Saimon Pitar svpw lo vngto okv ngui nvvtvnv vsaplo yarpok kunvnga agumbv rvvlinto, ngui ngv lvngola chamngu gula nvom gubv mvnwngngv rito; hoka achialv kujeka, vjaklodvbv vsap hv bokpwk mato. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Jisu bunua minto, “Aato okv dvto.” Lwbwlaksu vdwv yvv akonvka mvngpakla ninyia “No yvvla?” Vla tvvka nvgoka kaama, ogulvgavbolo bunu si Ahtu kv vla chintoku. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Vkvlvgabv Jisu vngla, vtwng nga naato okv bunua jitoku; okv ngui haka vbvdvdvbv rito.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Jisu sinam lokv turrapro kochingbv ninyigv lvbwlaksu vdwa kaarwk sunamv si lvom nvnvku.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu okv Pitar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Bunu dvro kochingbv, Jisu Saimon Pitarnyi minto, “Saimon, Jon gv kuunyilo, no ngam so kvvbi vdwgv ngam paknama kaiyabv pakya dunvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Hv mirwkto, “Vkv, Ahtu, nam ngoogv paknam ma no chindu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jisu ninyia minto, “Ngoogv svlarkuu vdwa alvbv kaaya laka.” <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Jisu lvnyi nvbv ninyia minto, “Saimon Jon gv kuunyilo, no ngam pakdunvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Hv mirwkto, “Vkv, Ahtu, nam ngoogv paknam a no chindu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jisu ninyia minto, “Ngoogv svlar vdwa alvbv kaaya laka.” <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Jisu lvom nvbv minto, “Saimon Jon gv kuunyilo, no nga pakdunvre?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Pitar mvngru toku ogulvgavbolo Jisu ninyia lvom go “No nga pakdunvre?” Vla tvvka kunam lvkwngbv vkvlvgabv hv Jisunyi minto, “Ahtu, no ogumvnwngnga chindunv; no chindu nam ngoogv paknama!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisu ninyia minto, “Ngoogv svlar vdwa alvbv kaaya laka. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Ngo nam jvjv nga minjidunv: nonugv yaapa rilo nonu ogolo vngso mvngpvdw no mvgemvrap sula vngdung vngbab karminto; vbvritola noogv nyikam rilo, no lak v laklin reku okv kvvbi akonv nam leeriku okv noogv vngso mvngma kolo vnggv reku.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>(Jisu gv ninyia svbv minam si Pitar silaku Pwknvyarnvnyi kaibv yunglit mosenga mintoku.) Vbvrikunamv Jisu ninyia “Nga vngming gvlaak!” vla mintoku.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisu la okv ninyigv kvvbi lvbwlaksu gunv</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:25">Jn 13:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pitar kaakor kaarwk namv Jisu gv paknam kvvbi lvbwlaksu anga adarlo dakdubv kaapato—hv Jisu gv dvnam dvgv rilo ninyigv nvchilo doolwk dvla “Ahtu nam yvvla koa tvdunv?” vla tvvkanv angv. <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Vdwlo Pitar ninyia kaapa tokudw, nw Jisunyi tvvkato, “Ahtu, ogubvla so nyi sum?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Jisu ninyia mirwkto, “Ngo ninyia ngoogv aakurma dvdvlo turbwng modubv mvngbolo, hv no gvbv ogubv ridula? Ngam vngming gvlaak!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Vkvlvgabv so lvbwlaksu angv simare vla yunying ngv jarkar toku Jisu gv rigvnam vdwgvlo. Vbvritola nw simare vla Jisu mimato; nw minto, “Ngo ninyia ngoogv aakurma dvdvlo turbwng modubv mvngbolo, hv no gvbv ogubv ridula?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Nw kuna lvbwlaksu angv yvvdw so vdw sum mindunv, okv sum lvkgap pvnv angv; okv ngonu chindu nw ogugo minpvkudw hv jvjv ngv.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minyakunam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Vjak, Jisu gv kvvbi aba rikunam dvdv ngv hoka achialv toku. Um akin akinbv lvknv guilo ngo mvngkanamv nyiamooku mvnwng si um lvkpv nama dvbwng nyulamare.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
